(860795, 97902, 21362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color</td>', 'Beautiful color', '2004-08-16 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(860799, 97904, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning, and the selective desaturation works really well here.  Absolutely love it.  10</td>', 'Simply stunning, and the selective desaturation works really well here.  Absolutely love it.  10', '2004-08-16 01:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(860810, 97652, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.  A very creative approach to this challenge, and well executed.  Love it. 10</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.  A very creative approach to this challenge, and well executed.  Love it. 10', '2004-08-16 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(860822, 97843, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and composition. Winner 9</td>', 'Beautiful color and composition. Winner 9', '2004-08-16 01:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(860833, 97982, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the backlighting ... (to tell you the truth, I was aiming for something like this but was not successful).  I wonder if you could make this more golden ... but it is wonderful as it is.  Congratulations and I hope this does well.</td>', 'Wow, love the backlighting ... (to tell you the truth, I was aiming for something like this but was not successful).  I wonder if you could make this more golden ... but it is wonderful as it is.  Congratulations and I hope this does well.', '2004-08-16 01:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(860834, 97041, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stunning! The lighting and glow in the center is awesome. (Even if it is post processing.)  Subtle pastel colors are exceptional.  Focus = perfect.  I''ve just started voting - but so far this is one its way to ribbonsville.</td>', 'Stunning! The lighting and glow in the center is awesome. (Even if it is post processing.)  Subtle pastel colors are exceptional.  Focus = perfect.  I''ve just started voting - but so far this is one its way to ribbonsville.', '2004-08-16 01:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(860837, 97011, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good humour, funny</td>', 'Good humour, funny', '2004-08-16 01:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(860839, 97803, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I like the simplicity of the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I like the simplicity of the composition.', '2004-08-16 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(860852, 97167, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro.  If it was mine, I''d probably have cloned or cropped out that bit of moisture in the corner.  But this is so good, it''s still an 8.</td>', 'Beautiful macro.  If it was mine, I''d probably have cloned or cropped out that bit of moisture in the corner.  But this is so good, it''s still an 8.', '2004-08-16 01:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(860860, 97984, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much like the way you have framed this flower.  It adds a great deal to the composition.</td>', 'I very much like the way you have framed this flower.  It adds a great deal to the composition.', '2004-08-16 01:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(860864, 97442, 14476, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm, nice one!  Maybe the bit in the lower right could have been eliminated, but still a very pleasing pattern and good ''n sharp.</td>', 'Mmmmm, nice one!  Maybe the bit in the lower right could have been eliminated, but still a very pleasing pattern and good ''n sharp.', '2004-08-16 01:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(860867, 97997, 20539, '<td valign="top">pond?</td>', 'pond?', '2004-08-16 01:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(860873, 97984, 16970, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I really like this.  The colour is amazing.  Great DOF and focus.  (10)</td>', 'Nice job.  I really like this.  The colour is amazing.  Great DOF and focus.  (10)', '2004-08-16 01:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(860880, 97830, 16970, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Botany Bay is some what different :)  I love waterfalls so you aren''t playing fair.   Great DOF.  The blow outs on the water actually make this photo IMO.  (10)</td>', 'Very nice.  Botany Bay is some what different :)  I love waterfalls so you aren''t playing fair.   Great DOF.  The blow outs on the water actually make this photo IMO.  (10)', '2004-08-16 01:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(860882, 97576, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I wish its height was set to 640 though. (8)</td>', 'Nice idea, I wish its height was set to 640 though. (8)', '2004-08-16 01:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(860888, 97930, 16970, '<td valign="top">If you con''t beat ''em join ''em.  Nice capture.  Great spin on the chalenge.  (10)</td>', 'If you con''t beat ''em join ''em.  Nice capture.  Great spin on the chalenge.  (10)', '2004-08-16 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(860889, 97904, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and title. I like the desat. (8)</td>', 'Nice idea and title. I like the desat. (8)', '2004-08-16 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(860892, 97336, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I wish the height was set to 640.</td>', 'Nice idea, I wish the height was set to 640.', '2004-08-16 01:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(860893, 97190, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Great color and capture of movement.  I am a big fan of such motion effects and this is well carried out (see my abstract entry for an example).</td>', 'Wonderful!  Great color and capture of movement.  I am a big fan of such motion effects and this is well carried out (see my abstract entry for an example).', '2004-08-16 01:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(860894, 97412, 7322, '<td valign="top">The jet stream cloud detracts from the tranquility and timelessness this shot scene should convey.<br/>It is a bit contrasty with rather faded looking color. I would suggest returning at a different time of day to take advantage of more interesting lighting.</td>', 'The jet stream cloud detracts from the tranquility and timelessness this shot scene should convey.It is a bit contrasty with rather faded looking color. I would suggest returning at a different time of day to take advantage of more interesting lighting.', '2004-08-16 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(860898, 96652, 20539, '<td valign="top">awsome, but what is with the border? it takes away so much from the image</td>', 'awsome, but what is with the border? it takes away so much from the image', '2004-08-16 01:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(860902, 97309, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!  Wish the bees were just a tad sharper...</td>', 'Nice colors!  Wish the bees were just a tad sharper...', '2004-08-16 01:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(860911, 97207, 19982, '<td valign="top">For me, the shot was just too ... well ... "normal", like something you''d see first thing walking into a nursery.  Perhaps walking around looking for a more interesting angle would have helped.  The other downside was the shadows that keep crossing from side to side.  It''s real hard to get a good exposure when you have both bright sunlight and shadows on the same subject.</td>', 'For me, the shot was just too ... well ... "normal", like something you''d see first thing walking into a nursery.  Perhaps walking around looking for a more interesting angle would have helped.  The other downside was the shadows that keep crossing from side to side.  It''s real hard to get a good exposure when you have both bright sunlight and shadows on the same subject.', '2004-08-16 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(860955, 97868, 19982, '<td valign="top">Interesting color and lighting. I like the fact that the shadows show up on the petals.</td>', 'Interesting color and lighting. I like the fact that the shadows show up on the petals.', '2004-08-16 02:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(860974, 97844, 10080, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! Best one I have seen!</td>', 'Great shot!!! Best one I have seen!', '2004-08-16 02:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(860977, 97843, 21362, '<td valign="top">That place looks really beautiful! Great photo too. Horizon might be a tad tilted but otherwise lovely. The colors are great. :)</td>', 'That place looks really beautiful! Great photo too. Horizon might be a tad tilted but otherwise lovely. The colors are great. :)', '2004-08-16 02:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
