(861116, 97652, 7263, '<td valign="top">heheh, hope she doesn''t eat the plant.<br/> <br/>Face looks kind of silver - but not enough so I know if it''s by design or accident. Nice idea however!<br/></td>', 'heheh, hope she doesn''t eat the plant. Face looks kind of silver - but not enough so I know if it''s by design or accident. Nice idea however!', '2004-08-16 05:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(861118, 97333, 7263, '<td valign="top">very nice and clean - simple idea well lit and executed.<br/> <br/>As a photo for publication work (i.e cover, advert etc) it is perfect. As a standalone photograph probably not so much as there isn''t much to look at apart from an old leaf.</td>', 'very nice and clean - simple idea well lit and executed. As a photo for publication work (i.e cover, advert etc) it is perfect. As a standalone photograph probably not so much as there isn''t much to look at apart from an old leaf.', '2004-08-16 05:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(861119, 97858, 7263, '<td valign="top">a nice ca[pture but not very nice colors. too artaficial.</td>', 'a nice ca[pture but not very nice colors. too artaficial.', '2004-08-16 05:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(861120, 97314, 7263, '<td valign="top">very nice and very clean but a bit too sharp and jagged for me.</td>', 'very nice and very clean but a bit too sharp and jagged for me.', '2004-08-16 05:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(861121, 97470, 7263, '<td valign="top">a nicely exposed sunflower shot - really do not like the border however ;(<br/> <br/></td>', 'a nicely exposed sunflower shot - really do not like the border however ;( ', '2004-08-16 05:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(861122, 97620, 7263, '<td valign="top">This is obviously well taken, but I fail to see any real impact area of the pic?</td>', 'This is obviously well taken, but I fail to see any real impact area of the pic?', '2004-08-16 05:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(861123, 97722, 7263, '<td valign="top">when your talking about quality of light / photographe etc nto many stand out - but this in my terms is great and what i want to see more of! Great use of DOF and superb focusing.<br/> <br/>The subject and composition don''t really get my vibes going - but then that is quite hard for a flower shot!<br/> <br/>Technicaly this is easily a 10.<br/> <br/></td>', 'when your talking about quality of light / photographe etc nto many stand out - but this in my terms is great and what i want to see more of! Great use of DOF and superb focusing. The subject and composition don''t really get my vibes going - but then that is quite hard for a flower shot! Technicaly this is easily a 10. ', '2004-08-16 05:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(861126, 97851, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very very nice photo of an otherwise ignored flower</td>', 'Very very nice photo of an otherwise ignored flower', '2004-08-16 05:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(861143, 97558, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent. 10! The different colours look great! How did you find all the right leaves? I think if you made the ''circle/cycle'' more obvious, rather than it looking like a line, it would be even better :)</td>', 'Excellent. 10! The different colours look great! How did you find all the right leaves? I think if you made the ''circle/cycle'' more obvious, rather than it looking like a line, it would be even better :)', '2004-08-16 06:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(861155, 97930, 318, '<td valign="top">Jellybeans? :)</td>', 'Jellybeans? :)', '2004-08-16 06:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(861160, 97789, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks like the image could use some more contrast. I also think I may have preferred this image in color.</td>', 'Looks like the image could use some more contrast. I also think I may have preferred this image in color.', '2004-08-16 06:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(861161, 97605, 5822, '<td valign="top">The post processing looks a bit much and imo doesn''t go with a picture that portrays botany which should be more of a representative type shot rather than the artistiic one you went for.  Same goes for the angle which you''ve cropped this shot in.</td>', 'The post processing looks a bit much and imo doesn''t go with a picture that portrays botany which should be more of a representative type shot rather than the artistiic one you went for.  Same goes for the angle which you''ve cropped this shot in.', '2004-08-16 06:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(861162, 97763, 24764, '<td valign="top">Top Ten shot, very imaginative and wonderful composition</td>', 'Top Ten shot, very imaginative and wonderful composition', '2004-08-16 06:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(861167, 97297, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective composition with the silhouetted trees in the foreground set against the less defined trees of the background and the fog.  Just not sure this is how a botonical photograph would look. This is more of an artistic treatment rather than a representative one you could study the plant with.</td>', 'I like the perspective composition with the silhouetted trees in the foreground set against the less defined trees of the background and the fog.  Just not sure this is how a botonical photograph would look. This is more of an artistic treatment rather than a representative one you could study the plant with.', '2004-08-16 06:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(861170, 96896, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice image with lots of sharp detail and natural color. I like the blue background and the light the plant is positioned in front of.  Could possibly have used a bit more fill light on the green and under petals.</td>', 'Very nice image with lots of sharp detail and natural color. I like the blue background and the light the plant is positioned in front of.  Could possibly have used a bit more fill light on the green and under petals.', '2004-08-16 06:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(861171, 98001, 5822, '<td valign="top">Red background overpowers the more diminutive and less saturated colored plant.  Would have liked to have seen you use a less bold background color for this plant. Need to see more detail in the leaves.</td>', 'Red background overpowers the more diminutive and less saturated colored plant.  Would have liked to have seen you use a less bold background color for this plant. Need to see more detail in the leaves.', '2004-08-16 07:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(861176, 97303, 24764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with a real sense of peacful sunset to it. There is freedom in this picture.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with a real sense of peacful sunset to it. There is freedom in this picture.', '2004-08-16 07:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(861178, 97428, 24764, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot</td>', 'Fascinating shot', '2004-08-16 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(861181, 98016, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice bright color and detail. I also like the simple composition and tack sharp image. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice bright color and detail. I also like the simple composition and tack sharp image. Nicely done.', '2004-08-16 07:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(861182, 97327, 21430, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh. If your camera allows it, this should be something you underexpose and then lighten up in your photoediting software. It would take care of some of the washed out places.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh. If your camera allows it, this should be something you underexpose and then lighten up in your photoediting software. It would take care of some of the washed out places.', '2004-08-16 07:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(861184, 97558, 20364, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2004-08-16 07:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(861185, 97470, 318, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Shame about the frame, though.</td>', 'Excellent! Shame about the frame, though.', '2004-08-16 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(861186, 97992, 5822, '<td valign="top">The red truck in the background is a big distraction. Also, would rather have had a close up look at these flowers. As it is, they are kind of dark and lack detail.</td>', 'The red truck in the background is a big distraction. Also, would rather have had a close up look at these flowers. As it is, they are kind of dark and lack detail.', '2004-08-16 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(861187, 97836, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great concept and the picture is very sharp! Would like to have seen the green leaves darker and more saturated and a bit more blurred to help isolate the white flower.</td>', 'Great concept and the picture is very sharp! Would like to have seen the green leaves darker and more saturated and a bit more blurred to help isolate the white flower.', '2004-08-16 07:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(861193, 98022, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good idea (because same as my submission :)<br/>A bit deeper DOF to get all the leaf in focus could probably improve. Nice lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Good idea (because same as my submission :)A bit deeper DOF to get all the leaf in focus could probably improve. Nice lighting and contrast.', '2004-08-16 07:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(861201, 97736, 5822, '<td valign="top">The shears look a bit out of place with them just stuck in the ground and no hand holding them.  Lots of nice color, but little on the detail.  This shot looks to me more of a gardening photograph rather than a botanical one.</td>', 'The shears look a bit out of place with them just stuck in the ground and no hand holding them.  Lots of nice color, but little on the detail.  This shot looks to me more of a gardening photograph rather than a botanical one.', '2004-08-16 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(861204, 97314, 8139, '<td valign="top">I had this idea too. Fortunately, I submitted something else, yours is very good. The white background contrasting with the black shadows gives it a strong impact. I probably had tilted a bit the leaf to lead to a more diagonal view.<br/>(hope my English is understandable :)</td>', 'I had this idea too. Fortunately, I submitted something else, yours is very good. The white background contrasting with the black shadows gives it a strong impact. I probably had tilted a bit the leaf to lead to a more diagonal view.(hope my English is understandable :)', '2004-08-16 07:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
