(861208, 97297, 8139, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. (I love poplars, they are so photogenic). Nice contrast between foreground and misty background.</td>', 'This is gorgeous. (I love poplars, they are so photogenic). Nice contrast between foreground and misty background.', '2004-08-16 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
