(861506, 97929, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I love how sharp and clear the focal plant is, and the great contrast of colors.</td>', 'Great picture.  I love how sharp and clear the focal plant is, and the great contrast of colors.', '2004-08-16 12:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
