(862195, 97950, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cool.  The whit background really sets off the plant and flowers.  I''m not a huge fan or borders, but this one is fairly non-obtrusive and holds it together nicely.  Exosure seems perfect as does the focus.</td>', 'Cool.  The whit background really sets off the plant and flowers.  I''m not a huge fan or borders, but this one is fairly non-obtrusive and holds it together nicely.  Exosure seems perfect as does the focus.', '2004-08-16 19:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
