(862206, 97828, 19608, '<td valign="top">Is that snow?!!  What a pleasant sight for me - it''s been over 100 degrees the past few days!  (It may be some take off on infared, but I don''t really think so.)  In any event, this is a creative and well execued B&amp;W.  Great blacks and good tonal range.  The snow in the shade is a bit grayish - but behind is perfect.  Composition could not be better.  Overall - this is full of impact and wow!  (Just finished voting on 100% - and expect you to be the pround owner of a new ribbon soon.)</td>', 'Is that snow?!!  What a pleasant sight for me - it''s been over 100 degrees the past few days!  (It may be some take off on infared, but I don''t really think so.)  In any event, this is a creative and well execued B&W.  Great blacks and good tonal range.  The snow in the shade is a bit grayish - but behind is perfect.  Composition could not be better.  Overall - this is full of impact and wow!  (Just finished voting on 100% - and expect you to be the pround owner of a new ribbon soon.)', '2004-08-16 19:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
