(862258, 97652, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am quite sure you will disagree with me but this photo doesn''t have plant life as a central theme. IMO it is secondary to the face which is clearly the subject of the photo. That being said, I like the picture. It is creative. Well composed. Well focused.</td>', 'I am quite sure you will disagree with me but this photo doesn''t have plant life as a central theme. IMO it is secondary to the face which is clearly the subject of the photo. That being said, I like the picture. It is creative. Well composed. Well focused.', '2004-08-16 20:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
