(862266, 96929, 18197, '<td valign="top">This afternoon I took a walk through the woods near our house and ate some nicely ripe blackberries just like these. So this resonates very well with me. Well done.</td>', 'This afternoon I took a walk through the woods near our house and ate some nicely ripe blackberries just like these. So this resonates very well with me. Well done.', '2004-08-16 20:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
