(862270, 97770, 18197, '<td valign="top">From my perspective, the strongest element of this photo are the buds near the top. The flower actually detracts. You might try to recrop this and see if it doesn''t improve the composition.</td>', 'From my perspective, the strongest element of this photo are the buds near the top. The flower actually detracts. You might try to recrop this and see if it doesn''t improve the composition.', '2004-08-16 20:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(862272, 97923, 18197, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors. Well composed. But it seems overlighted to me and therefore a bit flat. Suggest darkening it a bit, and up the contrast. Maybe some work with levels. It''s a good image but is either over or under-edited.</td>', 'Vibrant colors. Well composed. But it seems overlighted to me and therefore a bit flat. Suggest darkening it a bit, and up the contrast. Maybe some work with levels. It''s a good image but is either over or under-edited.', '2004-08-16 20:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(862276, 96947, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea nicely executed. A little more light on this side of the leaf might have created some reflections that would have given it greater depth.</td>', 'Good idea nicely executed. A little more light on this side of the leaf might have created some reflections that would have given it greater depth.', '2004-08-16 20:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(862277, 97347, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea nicely composed. Would be stronger if we could see either more or less of the background.</td>', 'Good idea nicely composed. Would be stronger if we could see either more or less of the background.', '2004-08-16 20:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(862280, 97608, 18197, '<td valign="top">I generally like well composed high contrast images and this is no exception. Colors, focus, DOF all seem spot on. Nice job.</td>', 'I generally like well composed high contrast images and this is no exception. Colors, focus, DOF all seem spot on. Nice job.', '2004-08-16 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(862282, 97723, 18197, '<td valign="top">At least on my monitor, this is pretty dark. I am afraid I am losing the significance of the various elements in the picture. It is vry busy and gives my eye no place to rest.</td>', 'At least on my monitor, this is pretty dark. I am afraid I am losing the significance of the various elements in the picture. It is vry busy and gives my eye no place to rest.', '2004-08-16 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(862284, 97750, 18197, '<td valign="top">The flower and the leaves are terrific! The face is terrific. Overall: Focus; DOF; Colors; Levels: and so on are very very good. But the combined comp with twin subjects leaves me confused. Show me a little more of the person and make sure I know without a doubt they are mesmerized by the plant.</td>', 'The flower and the leaves are terrific! The face is terrific. Overall: Focus; DOF; Colors; Levels: and so on are very very good. But the combined comp with twin subjects leaves me confused. Show me a little more of the person and make sure I know without a doubt they are mesmerized by the plant.', '2004-08-16 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(862285, 97905, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice flower capture. Dark and light background works well with the comp. In the middle of the pack of flower pics.</td>', 'Nice flower capture. Dark and light background works well with the comp. In the middle of the pack of flower pics.', '2004-08-16 20:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(862289, 97520, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like most of the details here. You''ve got a few highlights that are blown out. And the reflections look "dry" like the flower is dead rather than moist, waxy and alive. The black lump in the lower right doesn''t help. Maybe get closer to the bloom?</td>', 'I like most of the details here. You''ve got a few highlights that are blown out. And the reflections look "dry" like the flower is dead rather than moist, waxy and alive. The black lump in the lower right doesn''t help. Maybe get closer to the bloom?', '2004-08-16 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(862290, 97988, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice. I tried a few shots vry much like this and yours turned out way better than mine. I like the negative space almost as much as the positive subject image. Hope it does well in the voting.</td>', 'Nice. I tried a few shots vry much like this and yours turned out way better than mine. I like the negative space almost as much as the positive subject image. Hope it does well in the voting.', '2004-08-16 20:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(862293, 97542, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike image. I can clearly see it in a magazine ad, for example, with text in the large white spaces. But as a stand alone image, there is too little going on to sustain my interest.</td>', 'Good workmanlike image. I can clearly see it in a magazine ad, for example, with text in the large white spaces. But as a stand alone image, there is too little going on to sustain my interest.', '2004-08-16 20:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(862294, 97700, 6667, '<td valign="top">Why did you include ther blurred one?   The one up front is spectacular and shouldn''t be sharing the stage. IMHO  BOL</td>', 'Why did you include ther blurred one?   The one up front is spectacular and shouldn''t be sharing the stage. IMHO  BOL', '2004-08-16 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(862295, 97774, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Focus is incredible. Angle of the shot innovative. DOF is perfect. Good luck.</td>', 'Very well done. Focus is incredible. Angle of the shot innovative. DOF is perfect. Good luck.', '2004-08-16 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(862296, 97190, 6667, '<td valign="top">I certainly like the effect. . . but question the propiety to the challenge.</td>', 'I certainly like the effect. . . but question the propiety to the challenge.', '2004-08-16 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(862297, 98018, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice pastoral image. Good colors. Diffused lighting softens the image nicely. It would not have worked in full sun.</td>', 'Nice pastoral image. Good colors. Diffused lighting softens the image nicely. It would not have worked in full sun.', '2004-08-16 20:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(862301, 96769, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well composed and executed image. Doesn''t feel very "botanical" to me, but that doesn''t diminish it IMO. Focus is superb. Lighting of the flower is effective.</td>', 'Well composed and executed image. Doesn''t feel very "botanical" to me, but that doesn''t diminish it IMO. Focus is superb. Lighting of the flower is effective.', '2004-08-16 20:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(862302, 97348, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very unusual point of view. I had to look, look again, ... and again -- to finally see it. Colors are beautiful. Motion of the water is pretty neat. Overall this cools me off on a hot day and is soothing. Well done.</td>', 'Very unusual point of view. I had to look, look again, ... and again -- to finally see it. Colors are beautiful. Motion of the water is pretty neat. Overall this cools me off on a hot day and is soothing. Well done.', '2004-08-16 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(862304, 97968, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Tremendous focus. Lighting is superb. One of the very best I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Fantastic. Tremendous focus. Lighting is superb. One of the very best I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2004-08-16 20:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(862306, 97798, 18197, '<td valign="top">Everything about the mechanics of photo is fine but the subject and composition don''t grab my interest.</td>', 'Everything about the mechanics of photo is fine but the subject and composition don''t grab my interest.', '2004-08-16 20:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(862309, 96797, 6667, '<td valign="top">WOW Lighting and sharpness!</td>', 'WOW Lighting and sharpness!', '2004-08-16 20:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(862311, 97736, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. I showed it to my wife and she felt you had pasted the clipper into the photo. We looked at it way blown up and if so, you did a great job. I concluded it is a straight up shot, well executed, and well titled. Colors, focus, DOF and composition are very nice. Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful image. I showed it to my wife and she felt you had pasted the clipper into the photo. We looked at it way blown up and if so, you did a great job. I concluded it is a straight up shot, well executed, and well titled. Colors, focus, DOF and composition are very nice. Good luck.', '2004-08-16 20:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(862312, 97973, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image. Among the best of the flower pics. I like the focus, DOF and centered comp. Good luck.</td>', 'Great image. Among the best of the flower pics. I like the focus, DOF and centered comp. Good luck.', '2004-08-16 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(862316, 97900, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition of the image falls short of its other characteristics. What is the subject here? Certainly not the flora. A bit deeper DOF would make it more pleasing to me. That aside, it''s a nicely rendered image. And I''ll bet it was devilishly difficult to capture.</td>', 'Composition of the image falls short of its other characteristics. What is the subject here? Certainly not the flora. A bit deeper DOF would make it more pleasing to me. That aside, it''s a nicely rendered image. And I''ll bet it was devilishly difficult to capture.', '2004-08-16 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(862318, 97918, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.</td>', 'Nice landscape.', '2004-08-16 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(862319, 97858, 18197, '<td valign="top">This seems over saturated to me the blue channel work is so over the top it''s distracting. Maybe it''s all natural, but if the result of post processing, I''d suggest a lighter touch.</td>', 'This seems over saturated to me the blue channel work is so over the top it''s distracting. Maybe it''s all natural, but if the result of post processing, I''d suggest a lighter touch.', '2004-08-16 20:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(862321, 97483, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Tranquil feel to the photo. Nice job. Colors and shadows make the photo. Reflections are icing on the cake. Good job.</td>', 'Nice subject. Tranquil feel to the photo. Nice job. Colors and shadows make the photo. Reflections are icing on the cake. Good job.', '2004-08-16 20:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(862323, 97901, 18197, '<td valign="top">Focus, lighting and reflections are terrific. Comp is good. DOF is good. Background works. Too bad it''s got a bug to distract the eye.</td>', 'Focus, lighting and reflections are terrific. Comp is good. DOF is good. Background works. Too bad it''s got a bug to distract the eye.', '2004-08-16 20:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(862324, 97992, 6667, '<td valign="top">Oh Damn. . . couldn''t you move the truck and car?!!!  This is a fantastic shot but IMHO tarnished by those two background colors!  BOL</td>', 'Oh Damn. . . couldn''t you move the truck and car?!!!  This is a fantastic shot but IMHO tarnished by those two background colors!  BOL', '2004-08-16 20:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(862325, 97984, 18197, '<td valign="top">WOW! This will surely end up in my top 10 if not my top 3. The colors are vibrant without hurting my teeth. Background is as interesting as the foreground but compliments rather than competes. Very Very Nicely Done!</td>', 'WOW! This will surely end up in my top 10 if not my top 3. The colors are vibrant without hurting my teeth. Background is as interesting as the foreground but compliments rather than competes. Very Very Nicely Done!', '2004-08-16 20:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(862327, 97992, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sun flowers and their leaves are okay. The truck inthe background is a major distraction and pulls the rest of the image pretty far down.</td>', 'Sun flowers and their leaves are okay. The truck inthe background is a major distraction and pulls the rest of the image pretty far down.', '2004-08-16 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(862328, 96919, 6667, '<td valign="top">Would lie to see a slightly more saturated green. Never the less a nice study. BOL</td>', 'Would lie to see a slightly more saturated green. Never the less a nice study. BOL', '2004-08-16 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(862330, 97722, 18197, '<td valign="top">WOW! What a beautiful image. The lighting on this is so superior to most of what I''ve seen so far. It gives a truly 3 dimensional look to the image. The focus is dead on and the DOF is fantastic -- just shallow enough to blur the background, just deep enough to get the flower and its spikey leaves. This will certainly finish among the top 10.</td>', 'WOW! What a beautiful image. The lighting on this is so superior to most of what I''ve seen so far. It gives a truly 3 dimensional look to the image. The focus is dead on and the DOF is fantastic -- just shallow enough to blur the background, just deep enough to get the flower and its spikey leaves. This will certainly finish among the top 10.', '2004-08-16 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(862334, 97943, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject is okay but a little cliched. DOF is distracting. Composition could use some work. I think it would improve the picture if you had taken it from a more unusual perspective. Higher up (as in from a tree or the top of your car) or at a more oblique angle. As it is, it looks like it could have been shot through your car window.  Looks like it was shot mid-day. Try earlier in the morning or very late in the pre-sundown sunshine.</td>', 'Subject is okay but a little cliched. DOF is distracting. Composition could use some work. I think it would improve the picture if you had taken it from a more unusual perspective. Higher up (as in from a tree or the top of your car) or at a more oblique angle. As it is, it looks like it could have been shot through your car window.  Looks like it was shot mid-day. Try earlier in the morning or very late in the pre-sundown sunshine.', '2004-08-16 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(862339, 97041, 18197, '<td valign="top">WOW! My third wow in 10 minutes. Technically this is a virtually perfect photo. Combined with the subject matter, composition and lighting, it will surely be among the top 10. Good luck.</td>', 'WOW! My third wow in 10 minutes. Technically this is a virtually perfect photo. Combined with the subject matter, composition and lighting, it will surely be among the top 10. Good luck.', '2004-08-16 21:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(862341, 97853, 18197, '<td valign="top">The reds and grees that would normally contrast and add a dynamic element to the photo are so nearly identically saturated the blend together rather than contrast. This weakens the photo IMO.</td>', 'The reds and grees that would normally contrast and add a dynamic element to the photo are so nearly identically saturated the blend together rather than contrast. This weakens the photo IMO.', '2004-08-16 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(862344, 97252, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very cool. You have done a very nice job with the lighting to creat dimensionality in the photo. Choice of leaf is excellent for the topic and the dark background enhances image. I am sure you will get "centered comp" criticism but no other comp would have worked as well IMO. Great job!</td>', 'Very cool. You have done a very nice job with the lighting to creat dimensionality in the photo. Choice of leaf is excellent for the topic and the dark background enhances image. I am sure you will get "centered comp" criticism but no other comp would have worked as well IMO. Great job!', '2004-08-16 21:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(862347, 98011, 18197, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like borders but in this case, the border and its interaction with the flowers is one of the photo''s strongest features. Nicely done. Otherwise, the light pastel background weakens the photo IMO.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like borders but in this case, the border and its interaction with the flowers is one of the photo''s strongest features. Nicely done. Otherwise, the light pastel background weakens the photo IMO.', '2004-08-16 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(862349, 97829, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done among a genre of many similar images. Middle of that pack.</td>', 'Well done among a genre of many similar images. Middle of that pack.', '2004-08-16 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
