(862363, 97759, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like a number of individual aspects of this image: Shadows on the leaves; shadows on the wood; luminescent stalks; the angle of the image and how it fills the frame. But the overall effect seems harsh to me.</td>', 'I like a number of individual aspects of this image: Shadows on the leaves; shadows on the wood; luminescent stalks; the angle of the image and how it fills the frame. But the overall effect seems harsh to me.', '2004-08-16 21:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
