(862371, 97190, 18197, '<td valign="top">In taking the photo I submitted to this challenge, the wind was my greatest enemy. Nice to see your sense of humor triumph!</td>', 'In taking the photo I submitted to this challenge, the wind was my greatest enemy. Nice to see your sense of humor triumph!', '2004-08-16 21:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(862372, 97041, 2764, '<td valign="top">Stunning of course!  10 of course!  Looks like a fire pit of molten lava the blue tips on the yellow spikes are exquisite.  it looks like your light comes from deep inside the center and radaites outwards with the flower parts and petals.  Lovely color too,  How did you get all the spikes to line up in neat rows like that??</td>', 'Stunning of course!  10 of course!  Looks like a fire pit of molten lava the blue tips on the yellow spikes are exquisite.  it looks like your light comes from deep inside the center and radaites outwards with the flower parts and petals.  Lovely color too,  How did you get all the spikes to line up in neat rows like that??', '2004-08-16 21:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(862373, 97314, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject nicely captured. Bright background and harsh shadows detract. Suggest multiple light sources that are individually less intense.</td>', 'Nice subject nicely captured. Bright background and harsh shadows detract. Suggest multiple light sources that are individually less intense.', '2004-08-16 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
