(862405, 97736, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very good, very creative.  Great use of color.  I loved the darkened corners</td>', 'Very good, very creative.  Great use of color.  I loved the darkened corners', '2004-08-16 21:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(862407, 97519, 6667, '<td valign="top">They are like ours in the backyard. . . .need to be sprayed.  Very nice clean, crisp shot. BOL <br/>Question: Was this taken outside?  If so, how did you manage to get such a soft and even shaded background?  (I almost suspect photoshop because there are two or three small areas at the bottom that seem lighter.) Pray tell.</td>', 'They are like ours in the backyard. . . .need to be sprayed.  Very nice clean, crisp shot. BOL Question: Was this taken outside?  If so, how did you manage to get such a soft and even shaded background?  (I almost suspect photoshop because there are two or three small areas at the bottom that seem lighter.) Pray tell.', '2004-08-16 21:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(862408, 97671, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is good.  It really doesnt look real, however.  A little too unreal for me.  The clouds in the sunset seem to be too sharp.</td>', 'This is good.  It really doesnt look real, however.  A little too unreal for me.  The clouds in the sunset seem to be too sharp.', '2004-08-16 21:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
