(862413, 97936, 25150, '<td valign="top">recap: sorry for saying its out of focus, it just doesn''t seem clear to me. maybe it''s been over sharpened? blown up too much? Pixelated? There just doesn''t seem to be any detail in it. sorry.</td>', 'recap: sorry for saying its out of focus, it just doesn''t seem clear to me. maybe it''s been over sharpened? blown up too much? Pixelated? There just doesn''t seem to be any detail in it. sorry.', '2004-08-16 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(862415, 97904, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very good use of color.  very dramatic</td>', 'Very good use of color.  very dramatic', '2004-08-16 21:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(862418, 97961, 6667, '<td valign="top">. . with a tin cup for a chalice. . . fill it up with good red wine. . . I''m a chewen. . .   Sorry, the honeysuckle just triggered Jimmy Buffet.  I would have liked ot see a sharper  and larger picture of this. I feel it is one of the more unique subjects presented. BOL</td>', '. . with a tin cup for a chalice. . . fill it up with good red wine. . . I''m a chewen. . .   Sorry, the honeysuckle just triggered Jimmy Buffet.  I would have liked ot see a sharper  and larger picture of this. I feel it is one of the more unique subjects presented. BOL', '2004-08-16 22:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(862426, 97285, 19978, '<td valign="top">This shot has lots of things going for it: the composition and crop are excellent, but the small flowers on the right are quite blown, which distracts from your subject.</td>', 'This shot has lots of things going for it: the composition and crop are excellent, but the small flowers on the right are quite blown, which distracts from your subject.', '2004-08-16 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(862428, 98017, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot. It''s a beautiful statement of the ability of a good subject to "do the talking" without unnecessary frills. It could be a bit sharper, but the overall impact is not lessened at all. I also like the brown background.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot. It''s a beautiful statement of the ability of a good subject to "do the talking" without unnecessary frills. It could be a bit sharper, but the overall impact is not lessened at all. I also like the brown background.', '2004-08-16 22:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(862430, 97987, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you were going for here, but I think you missed the mark. The foreground flowers are a bit out of focus, and the composition is a bit too busy to allow for the overall pattern to stand out.</td>', 'I like the effect you were going for here, but I think you missed the mark. The foreground flowers are a bit out of focus, and the composition is a bit too busy to allow for the overall pattern to stand out.', '2004-08-16 22:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(862431, 97742, 24841, '<td valign="top">This just took my breath away....lovely!</td>', 'This just took my breath away....lovely!', '2004-08-16 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(862432, 97883, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. I think the composition is perfect and the simple colors of the subject against the vivid blue background is very powerful. With such a compelling subject, I think your choice of frame is a bit much though. A simple white line might have been the exclamation point!</td>', 'Simply beautiful. I think the composition is perfect and the simple colors of the subject against the vivid blue background is very powerful. With such a compelling subject, I think your choice of frame is a bit much though. A simple white line might have been the exclamation point!', '2004-08-16 22:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(862435, 97830, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. I like the fact that your shutter was fast enough not to morph the water into a continuous velvet blur. Perfect dof and a very nice composition.</td>', 'This is very nice. I like the fact that your shutter was fast enough not to morph the water into a continuous velvet blur. Perfect dof and a very nice composition.', '2004-08-16 22:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(862436, 97671, 24841, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is amazing!</td>', 'WOW!  This is amazing!', '2004-08-16 22:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(862439, 98011, 19978, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice and I like the subject spilling over the frame. Your greens seem a bit off though, and the busy background is sort of distracting.</td>', 'The composition is nice and I like the subject spilling over the frame. Your greens seem a bit off though, and the busy background is sort of distracting.', '2004-08-16 22:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(862442, 97961, 19978, '<td valign="top">Too small. I think your choice of subject is very nice, but you needed to use the space allowed to make it really stand out.</td>', 'Too small. I think your choice of subject is very nice, but you needed to use the space allowed to make it really stand out.', '2004-08-16 22:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(862443, 97955, 24841, '<td valign="top">I love the texture!</td>', 'I love the texture!', '2004-08-16 22:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(862446, 97843, 19978, '<td valign="top">Overall a very nice shot, one that I would certainly like to emulate. However, I think you could have done more with levels, curves and contrast. For example, the blue sky and clouds should "pop" a bit more. The mountains along the horizon should also stand out a bit sharper. With the advantage of advanced editing rules, you can do these things and not compromise the integrity of your photo.</td>', 'Overall a very nice shot, one that I would certainly like to emulate. However, I think you could have done more with levels, curves and contrast. For example, the blue sky and clouds should "pop" a bit more. The mountains along the horizon should also stand out a bit sharper. With the advantage of advanced editing rules, you can do these things and not compromise the integrity of your photo.', '2004-08-16 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(862448, 97702, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot of this lilly but I think you cropped it a bit too close. Good clarity and lighting though...</td>', 'A beautiful shot of this lilly but I think you cropped it a bit too close. Good clarity and lighting though...', '2004-08-16 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(862451, 97765, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love your vision and imagination. This is a great composition for the challenge and a wonderful way to make a fern stand out. Great shot!</td>', 'I love your vision and imagination. This is a great composition for the challenge and a wonderful way to make a fern stand out. Great shot!', '2004-08-16 22:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(862453, 97676, 19978, '<td valign="top">There''s something about your photo that really works. It''s simple, yet has a number of very compelling elements that reward closer inspection. The purple hues of the stems and flower, the beautiful greens, the nearly concealed yellow bloom (?), and the contrast of the tack-sharp web against the softly blurred background... I could go on. Excellent vision to have seen this and made it work as well as you did. 8.</td>', 'There''s something about your photo that really works. It''s simple, yet has a number of very compelling elements that reward closer inspection. The purple hues of the stems and flower, the beautiful greens, the nearly concealed yellow bloom (?), and the contrast of the tack-sharp web against the softly blurred background... I could go on. Excellent vision to have seen this and made it work as well as you did. 8.', '2004-08-16 22:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(862455, 97246, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply stated, powerfully beautiful. Elegant and effective. I''m a sucker for a simple composition on a black background. Your lines and angles are great. Maybe a bit more negative space (de-centered subject) would have made it even more powerful. Excellent job! 8</td>', 'Simply stated, powerfully beautiful. Elegant and effective. I''m a sucker for a simple composition on a black background. Your lines and angles are great. Maybe a bit more negative space (de-centered subject) would have made it even more powerful. Excellent job! 8', '2004-08-16 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(862457, 97811, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but I find that the yellow seems quite washed out.  Could have underexposed this shot a little or could have been burned a bit to darken those petals.  Nice focus on the central part of the flower with the bees.</td>', 'Interesting image, but I find that the yellow seems quite washed out.  Could have underexposed this shot a little or could have been burned a bit to darken those petals.  Nice focus on the central part of the flower with the bees.', '2004-08-16 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(862458, 98001, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully simple idea - executed with elegance and style. I''m impressed by how well your choice of background colors works. Very nice.</td>', 'A wonderfully simple idea - executed with elegance and style. I''m impressed by how well your choice of background colors works. Very nice.', '2004-08-16 22:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(862459, 97992, 23680, '<td valign="top">The truck is very distracting</td>', 'The truck is very distracting', '2004-08-16 22:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(862460, 97470, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is a great compositional approach. The frame might be a little bit overdone but the idea of the flower rising out of the bottom of the frame, suggesting sunrise to me, is exceptional.</td>', 'This is a great compositional approach. The frame might be a little bit overdone but the idea of the flower rising out of the bottom of the frame, suggesting sunrise to me, is exceptional.', '2004-08-16 22:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(862461, 97992, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about those trucks in the background.</td>', 'Too bad about those trucks in the background.', '2004-08-16 22:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(862463, 97337, 23680, '<td valign="top">different - nice</td>', 'different - nice', '2004-08-16 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(862464, 97836, 7204, '<td valign="top">great picture!  :)  i love the crisp whiteness of the flower!  hats off to the gardener, too!  (wink, wink!)</td>', 'great picture!  :)  i love the crisp whiteness of the flower!  hats off to the gardener, too!  (wink, wink!)', '2004-08-16 22:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(862465, 97941, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I think it would have been more effective if the sofa(?) was not in the picture</td>', 'Nice shot - I think it would have been more effective if the sofa(?) was not in the picture', '2004-08-16 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(862466, 97801, 19978, '<td valign="top">Your composition is an idea which has been tried many times, but you managed to make it work. My eye is drawn to the simplicity and beauty suggested here. The lone leaf hanging from the flower is the only weakness, IMO, but maybe it also adds a bit of interest. Nicely done!</td>', 'Your composition is an idea which has been tried many times, but you managed to make it work. My eye is drawn to the simplicity and beauty suggested here. The lone leaf hanging from the flower is the only weakness, IMO, but maybe it also adds a bit of interest. Nicely done!', '2004-08-16 22:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(862468, 97958, 23680, '<td valign="top">background seems too bright</td>', 'background seems too bright', '2004-08-16 22:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(862470, 97347, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I like the element of backlighting the foreground flower. Against the black background, it really pops. I think  you could have eliminated the background fern altogether and used the negative space to accentuate the subject even more.</td>', 'Beautifully done. I like the element of backlighting the foreground flower. Against the black background, it really pops. I think  you could have eliminated the background fern altogether and used the negative space to accentuate the subject even more.', '2004-08-16 22:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(862471, 97671, 11738, '<td valign="top">I find the went over the top with the sky.  Looks way too artificial.  Also, the sunflowers look so faded.  I think a less heavy-handed approach to editing could have amde this shot more pleasant.  As it now stands, they eyes are drawn to the blasted out highlights of the clouds.  Gives the shot an aggressive feel.  Consider re-editing this after the challenge.</td>', 'I find the went over the top with the sky.  Looks way too artificial.  Also, the sunflowers look so faded.  I think a less heavy-handed approach to editing could have amde this shot more pleasant.  As it now stands, they eyes are drawn to the blasted out highlights of the clouds.  Gives the shot an aggressive feel.  Consider re-editing this after the challenge.', '2004-08-16 22:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(862473, 97750, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong composition. Interestingly, I think it would have also worked without the child''s face.</td>', 'This is a very strong composition. Interestingly, I think it would have also worked without the child''s face.', '2004-08-16 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(862474, 97700, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice macro - I would have liked to see a darker background - good job!</td>', 'Nice macro - I would have liked to see a darker background - good job!', '2004-08-16 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(862475, 97676, 23680, '<td valign="top">i like the color contrast between the berries and the stems</td>', 'i like the color contrast between the berries and the stems', '2004-08-16 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
