(863523, 97448, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract image but so busy my eye can''t find a place to rest.Colors are very good. Contrast and focus are very good. It "feels" like a late summer field. I can almost sense the pollen.</td>', 'Nice abstract image but so busy my eye can''t find a place to rest.Colors are very good. Contrast and focus are very good. It "feels" like a late summer field. I can almost sense the pollen.', '2004-08-17 17:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(863526, 97412, 18197, '<td valign="top">This image is well focused, the colors are good, levels are good but the composition lets it down. It''s pretty busy and there''s no obvious subject or central idea. Trees and sky in the background don''t really contribute to the image. I think getting a lot closer and finding a subject/theme to convey would help.</td>', 'This image is well focused, the colors are good, levels are good but the composition lets it down. It''s pretty busy and there''s no obvious subject or central idea. Trees and sky in the background don''t really contribute to the image. I think getting a lot closer and finding a subject/theme to convey would help.', '2004-08-17 17:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(863529, 97929, 18197, '<td valign="top">Are those jelly beans? Seriously, I like the photo. the contrast of red and green increases the vibrancy of the picture. It feels unbalanced to me, like it''s going to fall over on the left. A more balanced composition whould have helped for me.</td>', 'Are those jelly beans? Seriously, I like the photo. the contrast of red and green increases the vibrancy of the picture. It feels unbalanced to me, like it''s going to fall over on the left. A more balanced composition whould have helped for me.', '2004-08-17 17:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(863531, 97088, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, DOF, composition. The desaturated image seems to work well (or maybe it''s a white flower). Water droplets add interest. Very little to complain about. I might hve tried scissors on the errant stalk ... but there goes truth in botany.</td>', 'Very nice focus, DOF, composition. The desaturated image seems to work well (or maybe it''s a white flower). Water droplets add interest. Very little to complain about. I might hve tried scissors on the errant stalk ... but there goes truth in botany.', '2004-08-17 17:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(863534, 97862, 18197, '<td valign="top">This works fine as an abstrct image. It is clearly detailed (as in a study) which ties in nicely with the theme.  I could become intrigued by the science and math of the cell placement, but subject doesn''t resonate as well with me as others in the challenge.</td>', 'This works fine as an abstrct image. It is clearly detailed (as in a study) which ties in nicely with the theme.  I could become intrigued by the science and math of the cell placement, but subject doesn''t resonate as well with me as others in the challenge.', '2004-08-17 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(863536, 97943, 24996, '<td valign="top">This picture really speaks to me.  The center flower seems to be like, "Hey, Listen to me."  While the rest are either talking to one another or trying to listen. Great photography.</td>', 'This picture really speaks to me.  The center flower seems to be like, "Hey, Listen to me."  While the rest are either talking to one another or trying to listen. Great photography.', '2004-08-17 17:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
