(864954, 97309, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and I really like the shallow DOF effect which gives the image a graphic feel.  I especially like the extreme blur of the background. I think there could be a bit more light on the flower and bees to bring out some more detail in the bees.</td>', 'Nice colors and I really like the shallow DOF effect which gives the image a graphic feel.  I especially like the extreme blur of the background. I think there could be a bit more light on the flower and bees to bring out some more detail in the bees.', '2004-08-18 08:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(864969, 97576, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones in this pic! This is a great image and the only thing I can see for improvement would to have the water come out of the can in a sprinkle instead of stream, but then you would have to tilt the can more and mess with the composition. Nonetheless, very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful tones in this pic! This is a great image and the only thing I can see for improvement would to have the water come out of the can in a sprinkle instead of stream, but then you would have to tilt the can more and mess with the composition. Nonetheless, very well done.', '2004-08-18 08:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(865000, 97167, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and color.  Perfect as it is.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and color.  Perfect as it is.', '2004-08-18 08:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
