(865686, 97900, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF but I think a higher shooting angle down on the flowers and butterfly would have been better to show the shapes better. Also a crop off of the top would be good too.</td>', 'Very nice DOF but I think a higher shooting angle down on the flowers and butterfly would have been better to show the shapes better. Also a crop off of the top would be good too.', '2004-08-18 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(865688, 97930, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photograph but this would come under the term of zoology more. Also, the red at the top of the image is distracting.</td>', 'Very interesting photograph but this would come under the term of zoology more. Also, the red at the top of the image is distracting.', '2004-08-18 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(865702, 97799, 5822, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge very well, perhaps better than any I''ve seen so far. I especially like the composition.  The various angles formed here by the branch and leaves suggest an esthetic and a science.  The backlighting is brilliant and you''ve really brought out the veins of the leaves so well.  The green agaisnt the black background really brings out the color in the leaves. The only improvement I could see is possibly less sharpening, as it appears possibly oversharpened.  Very well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'Meets the challenge very well, perhaps better than any I''ve seen so far. I especially like the composition.  The various angles formed here by the branch and leaves suggest an esthetic and a science.  The backlighting is brilliant and you''ve really brought out the veins of the leaves so well.  The green agaisnt the black background really brings out the color in the leaves. The only improvement I could see is possibly less sharpening, as it appears possibly oversharpened.  Very well done, nonetheless.', '2004-08-18 13:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(865714, 96652, 5822, '<td valign="top">A very  beautiful minimalistic and artistic image with an oriental feel, but doesn''t meet the challenge, imo.  Perhaps a bit more saturation of the green leaves?</td>', 'A very  beautiful minimalistic and artistic image with an oriental feel, but doesn''t meet the challenge, imo.  Perhaps a bit more saturation of the green leaves?', '2004-08-18 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
