(865727, 97631, 5822, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus and very good DOF with such vibrant color! Wonderful photo.  More artistic than representative, which I think would be better served for the challenge theme.</td>', 'Crisp focus and very good DOF with such vibrant color! Wonderful photo.  More artistic than representative, which I think would be better served for the challenge theme.', '2004-08-18 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
