(866130, 97652, 25626, '<td valign="top">Beautiful connection between humanity and botany. And the way her eyes match the leaves is awesome.</td>', 'Beautiful connection between humanity and botany. And the way her eyes match the leaves is awesome.', '2004-08-18 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(866165, 97723, 7628, '<td valign="top">In this very busy image you''ve done two things to simplify - narrow DOF to blurr the background and isolate the subject, and desaturate to draw attention.  But my eyes are draw two ways - the bright desaturated flower - and then the dragon fly which is not at first apparent.  I think desaturating the dragon fly would work better - or desaturate all the plant life - show how plant and animal life are different...</td>', 'In this very busy image you''ve done two things to simplify - narrow DOF to blurr the background and isolate the subject, and desaturate to draw attention.  But my eyes are draw two ways - the bright desaturated flower - and then the dragon fly which is not at first apparent.  I think desaturating the dragon fly would work better - or desaturate all the plant life - show how plant and animal life are different...', '2004-08-18 17:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(866166, 97798, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting bark - makes a good subject.  The bright yellow leaves are a distraction. If those are leaves of this tree perhaps including them with a larger DOF so both are sharp would pull the image together.</td>', 'Interesting bark - makes a good subject.  The bright yellow leaves are a distraction. If those are leaves of this tree perhaps including them with a larger DOF so both are sharp would pull the image together.', '2004-08-18 17:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(866171, 96947, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice tiny details - those little veins that come off the very large ones  - nicely done with the back lighting.  I wish there were one area to draw the attention, this composition lets the eyes wander in then wander right off without stopping long.</td>', 'nice tiny details - those little veins that come off the very large ones  - nicely done with the back lighting.  I wish there were one area to draw the attention, this composition lets the eyes wander in then wander right off without stopping long.', '2004-08-18 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(866173, 97539, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like seeing a large "botanical" specimen such as this.Like the intensity of the sun sneaking through the choice. Nice gradiant colors of the sky and hills.</td>', 'Like seeing a large "botanical" specimen such as this.Like the intensity of the sun sneaking through the choice. Nice gradiant colors of the sky and hills.', '2004-08-18 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(866174, 97877, 7628, '<td valign="top">The brightness and high contrast of this image makes you feel the sun and the heat - very appropriate for the subject.  The blue and gold work well together.  I like how the grain "invades" the sky with a roit of spikes.  Wish it were sharper<br/></td>', 'The brightness and high contrast of this image makes you feel the sun and the heat - very appropriate for the subject.  The blue and gold work well together.  I like how the grain "invades" the sky with a roit of spikes.  Wish it were sharper', '2004-08-18 17:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(866176, 97783, 24846, '<td valign="top">Not just a botanical picture, but a study of propogation. Like the motion and colors</td>', 'Not just a botanical picture, but a study of propogation. Like the motion and colors', '2004-08-18 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(866177, 98020, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the white and the tomato.  I like the deepening red in the shadow side of the tomato.  I wish it were sharper, and I think a bit more white around the tomato would frame it better, perhaps the folds would be either more curving to mimic the shape of the tomato, or more angular to contrat with it.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the white and the tomato.  I like the deepening red in the shadow side of the tomato.  I wish it were sharper, and I think a bit more white around the tomato would frame it better, perhaps the folds would be either more curving to mimic the shape of the tomato, or more angular to contrat with it.', '2004-08-18 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(866179, 97668, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun idea - a house plant from a wooden man persective. The lighting here washes out the leaves and the grain of the wood - perhaps with lighting from the sides could create some more drama or mystery?  If your figure belongw to this "landscape" perhaps you could give him (her) some leafy clothing or some other touch to make him fit in better.</td>', 'Fun idea - a house plant from a wooden man persective. The lighting here washes out the leaves and the grain of the wood - perhaps with lighting from the sides could create some more drama or mystery?  If your figure belongw to this "landscape" perhaps you could give him (her) some leafy clothing or some other touch to make him fit in better.', '2004-08-18 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(866182, 97934, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  I like the angle of the bird swooping in toward the flower.  The green stem in the background distracts - removing it and having just the dark background with mottled bits of green would make the bird "pop" better.</td>', 'Nice capture!  I like the angle of the bird swooping in toward the flower.  The green stem in the background distracts - removing it and having just the dark background with mottled bits of green would make the bird "pop" better.', '2004-08-18 17:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(866186, 96971, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the range of reds.  The focus is soft and the effect makes the cherries glow a bit.  I wish there were a spot to focus of but the composition feels random.  The blurry leaves in the forground make the viewer fight to see the image - perhaps narrow down the subject by finding an angle with a few leaves and berries that can be shot all in focus.</td>', 'I like the range of reds.  The focus is soft and the effect makes the cherries glow a bit.  I wish there were a spot to focus of but the composition feels random.  The blurry leaves in the forground make the viewer fight to see the image - perhaps narrow down the subject by finding an angle with a few leaves and berries that can be shot all in focus.', '2004-08-18 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(866191, 97542, 7628, '<td valign="top">Simple is a good idea.   I wish leaves were a little sharper - more detailed.   Backlighting can give more detail in leaves.  The blue shadows are a biit odd particularly the shadowon the top left.  An even and empty background would work better.</td>', 'Simple is a good idea.   I wish leaves were a little sharper - more detailed.   Backlighting can give more detail in leaves.  The blue shadows are a biit odd particularly the shadowon the top left.  An even and empty background would work better.', '2004-08-18 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(866198, 98019, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like isolating the sculpture amid the green - between the rounded green hedges below and the vertical lines of the trees above.  Gives the eyes places to wander but always come back to the obvious point of focus.  The light on the sculpturewashed out the details on the top of the left side.  Perhaps a slighting darker exposure.</td>', 'I like isolating the sculpture amid the green - between the rounded green hedges below and the vertical lines of the trees above.  Gives the eyes places to wander but always come back to the obvious point of focus.  The light on the sculpturewashed out the details on the top of the left side.  Perhaps a slighting darker exposure.', '2004-08-18 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(866204, 96645, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The lighting doesn''t do justice to the details that must be in these ferns - backlighting or some dramatic light from both sides.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The lighting doesn''t do justice to the details that must be in these ferns - backlighting or some dramatic light from both sides.', '2004-08-18 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(866210, 97732, 7628, '<td valign="top">A fun idea!  The roots reaching out to the watering can are great!  I think if the spout were pointed away from the plant it would create more motivation.  The light is too yellow - you can adjust in the camera before you shoot of fix in photoshop.  A whiteboard placed right would get rid of relections in the surfaceof the watering can.</td>', 'A fun idea!  The roots reaching out to the watering can are great!  I think if the spout were pointed away from the plant it would create more motivation.  The light is too yellow - you can adjust in the camera before you shoot of fix in photoshop.  A whiteboard placed right would get rid of relections in the surfaceof the watering can.', '2004-08-18 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(866214, 97929, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF to isolate your subject.  I wish the bottom of the left-most pod were in the picture - the pod is the main subject being the one in sharp focus, but having in go off the bottom leads the eye away from the picture before you get a chance to look at the rest of the image,</td>', 'Nice use of DOF to isolate your subject.  I wish the bottom of the left-most pod were in the picture - the pod is the main subject being the one in sharp focus, but having in go off the bottom leads the eye away from the picture before you get a chance to look at the rest of the image,', '2004-08-18 17:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(866218, 97802, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely and delicate - I particularly like that you''ve chosen to show the back of the flower, not the front - the dark line of the stem leads the eye from flower to flower (wish the curve at the top wasn;t cropped so tight!).  The lighting illuminates the petals and the washed out white of the background is an effectve background. 8</td>', 'Lovely and delicate - I particularly like that you''ve chosen to show the back of the flower, not the front - the dark line of the stem leads the eye from flower to flower (wish the curve at the top wasn;t cropped so tight!).  The lighting illuminates the petals and the washed out white of the background is an effectve background. 8', '2004-08-18 17:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(866220, 96914, 7628, '<td valign="top">Bizzar and fun to look at, but in the end more of a game than a piece of art.  Too unreal for this "botany" topic.</td>', 'Bizzar and fun to look at, but in the end more of a game than a piece of art.  Too unreal for this "botany" topic.', '2004-08-18 17:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(866222, 97942, 13336, '<td valign="top">nice!  interesting method of drawing focus both with the mag class and the saturation difference.  very clever, and nicely composed, strong color.  good work.</td>', 'nice!  interesting method of drawing focus both with the mag class and the saturation difference.  very clever, and nicely composed, strong color.  good work.', '2004-08-18 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(866224, 97620, 7628, '<td valign="top">innovative subject, and interesting choice to reflect it.  I''m not sure I like everything so centered -both horizontally and vertically. Perhaps an off-set composition would make it more interesting.  The black backgroung is a good choice to make the roots really show up and glow against it.</td>', 'innovative subject, and interesting choice to reflect it.  I''m not sure I like everything so centered -both horizontally and vertically. Perhaps an off-set composition would make it more interesting.  The black backgroung is a good choice to make the roots really show up and glow against it.', '2004-08-18 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(866229, 97666, 7628, '<td valign="top">A truely loveloy composition.  I like the balance, symetry and solidity of the stone arch, and how it frames the more natural scene behind it.  I like how the rocks tumble at an angle and the ferns peek out under the arch.  Perhaps framing it with a touch more room to the left and below you invite the viewer to enter the scene more - moving into the photo from the left ?</td>', 'A truely loveloy composition.  I like the balance, symetry and solidity of the stone arch, and how it frames the more natural scene behind it.  I like how the rocks tumble at an angle and the ferns peek out under the arch.  Perhaps framing it with a touch more room to the left and below you invite the viewer to enter the scene more - moving into the photo from the left ?', '2004-08-18 18:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(866232, 97872, 13336, '<td valign="top">the sky is completely blown out from overexposure.  try using a flash to bring the exposure of the tree so it can match that of the sky.  interesting angle.</td>', 'the sky is completely blown out from overexposure.  try using a flash to bring the exposure of the tree so it can match that of the sky.  interesting angle.', '2004-08-18 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(866233, 97088, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice details!  I cannot stop looking at this!  There is so much to see - the textures and tones.  I like the inclusion of the water drops.</td>', 'Nice details!  I cannot stop looking at this!  There is so much to see - the textures and tones.  I like the inclusion of the water drops.', '2004-08-18 18:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(866236, 97828, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the curve of this picture and how well it works with the title.  Obviously the infared makes it very fantastic - fairy winter land.  I like how the brightness, featheryness of the leaves contrasts with the dark winkled bark! The bench welcomes to viewer to sit down and enjoy the image for a while.  Excellent. 10</td>', 'I love the curve of this picture and how well it works with the title.  Obviously the infared makes it very fantastic - fairy winter land.  I like how the brightness, featheryness of the leaves contrasts with the dark winkled bark! The bench welcomes to viewer to sit down and enjoy the image for a while.  Excellent. 10', '2004-08-18 18:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(866238, 97336, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun, funny!  I do wish the shadow of the monster plant seemes larger and more threatening.</td>', 'Fun, funny!  I do wish the shadow of the monster plant seemes larger and more threatening.', '2004-08-18 18:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(866242, 97485, 7628, '<td valign="top">magical lighting, wonderful and appropriate soft focus.  Although I see the reflections and know it is water - is feels like these flowers are floating in the night intself.  Lovely golden and rosy yellows.</td>', 'magical lighting, wonderful and appropriate soft focus.  Although I see the reflections and know it is water - is feels like these flowers are floating in the night intself.  Lovely golden and rosy yellows.', '2004-08-18 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(866244, 97428, 25525, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!</td>', 'I love this photo!', '2004-08-18 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(866246, 97700, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like that you can still see the brick path beyond the flowers - having the other flower half way between the subject and the path acts as an intermediary between the main flower and the background.  I like the subtle diagonal created by the bricks that leads us in from the top left and right to that dramaticly framed flower which is crisp and full of color! 9</td>', 'I like that you can still see the brick path beyond the flowers - having the other flower half way between the subject and the path acts as an intermediary between the main flower and the background.  I like the subtle diagonal created by the bricks that leads us in from the top left and right to that dramaticly framed flower which is crisp and full of color! 9', '2004-08-18 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(866247, 97576, 22269, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote...but wow!  I love this shot! Great job.</td>', 'I can''t vote...but wow!  I love this shot! Great job.', '2004-08-18 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(866251, 97789, 7628, '<td valign="top">a fine idea for this challenge - The rular helps us understant the diminutive nature of the flower and appreciate it delicateness.  Both practical and pretty. 8</td>', 'a fine idea for this challenge - The rular helps us understant the diminutive nature of the flower and appreciate it delicateness.  Both practical and pretty. 8', '2004-08-18 18:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(866254, 97177, 20941, '<td valign="top">clever, well executed!</td>', 'clever, well executed!', '2004-08-18 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(866256, 97337, 7628, '<td valign="top">great details, and I like how we see the back, not the front,of the flower.</td>', 'great details, and I like how we see the back, not the front,of the flower.', '2004-08-18 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(866269, 98004, 6130, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-08-18 18:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(866297, 97309, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great capture and composition.  Focus is soft</td>', 'Great capture and composition.  Focus is soft', '2004-08-18 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(866300, 97980, 9690, '<td valign="top">I must be dense, cause I dont get the point</td>', 'I must be dense, cause I dont get the point', '2004-08-18 18:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(866301, 97483, 9690, '<td valign="top">Nice, but typical</td>', 'Nice, but typical', '2004-08-18 18:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(866303, 97485, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice lighting and nice touch with the soft focus.  They look like they are in spotlights.  Possibly reminicient of Fantasia</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice lighting and nice touch with the soft focus.  They look like they are in spotlights.  Possibly reminicient of Fantasia', '2004-08-18 18:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(866304, 97723, 9690, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast.  Plus, there is no real clear focus to the pic</td>', 'Too much contrast.  Plus, there is no real clear focus to the pic', '2004-08-18 18:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(866305, 97942, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  There are others similar to this in the challenge, but this is my fav so far.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I like this alot.  There are others similar to this in the challenge, but this is my fav so far.  Keep up the good work!', '2004-08-18 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(866307, 97190, 9690, '<td valign="top">Interesting take and neat-o looking shot!  it is very stunning</td>', 'Interesting take and neat-o looking shot!  it is very stunning', '2004-08-18 18:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(866308, 97936, 9690, '<td valign="top">Yes, fuzzy does describe that sprig ;)<br/></td>', 'Yes, fuzzy does describe that sprig ;)', '2004-08-18 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(866310, 97088, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-08-18 18:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(866312, 97303, 9690, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-08-18 18:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(866313, 97668, 9690, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.</td>', 'Interesting take.', '2004-08-18 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(866314, 98012, 9690, '<td valign="top">All the spots kinda ruin it.  I assume its underwater, but, other than the title, it is hard to determine that the water is making the pic look that way</td>', 'All the spots kinda ruin it.  I assume its underwater, but, other than the title, it is hard to determine that the water is making the pic look that way', '2004-08-18 18:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(866316, 97666, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective color.  Looks like a door to a magical place!  Excellent job</td>', 'Great use of selective color.  Looks like a door to a magical place!  Excellent job', '2004-08-18 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(866317, 97330, 9690, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Great colors and balance of foreground/background</td>', 'Love this!  Great colors and balance of foreground/background', '2004-08-18 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(866318, 96893, 9690, '<td valign="top">Kind of mundane.  It doesnt take much to point the camera into the trees</td>', 'Kind of mundane.  It doesnt take much to point the camera into the trees', '2004-08-18 19:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(866319, 97836, 9690, '<td valign="top">I dont care to see the hand in the pic</td>', 'I dont care to see the hand in the pic', '2004-08-18 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(866323, 97801, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very good use of contrasting colors.  You pulled it off well.  I like the "halo" around the flower ~10</td>', 'Very good use of contrasting colors.  You pulled it off well.  I like the "halo" around the flower ~10', '2004-08-18 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(866324, 97576, 9690, '<td valign="top">The lighting is uninspiring</td>', 'The lighting is uninspiring', '2004-08-18 19:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(866326, 97883, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the use of color here</td>', 'I like the lighting and the use of color here', '2004-08-18 19:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(866330, 98023, 25195, '<td valign="top">the leaf itself is mildly interesting, but the lighting is SUPERB!  I hope to get tothis level someday.   Nice capture.<br/></td>', 'the leaf itself is mildly interesting, but the lighting is SUPERB!  I hope to get tothis level someday.   Nice capture.', '2004-08-18 19:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(866363, 97843, 3569, '<td valign="top">excellent habitat shot.</td>', 'excellent habitat shot.', '2004-08-18 19:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(866366, 97934, 3569, '<td valign="top">I might have called the shot "pollination" to better fit the challenge, but great shot anyway.</td>', 'I might have called the shot "pollination" to better fit the challenge, but great shot anyway.', '2004-08-18 19:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(866371, 97930, 3569, '<td valign="top">To me this needs to be verticle, but still one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'To me this needs to be verticle, but still one of the best in this challenge.', '2004-08-18 19:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(866374, 97190, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract sunflower, but hard to determine botany here.</td>', 'Nice abstract sunflower, but hard to determine botany here.', '2004-08-18 19:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(866377, 96756, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, loss of any texture.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, loss of any texture.', '2004-08-18 19:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(866378, 96723, 3569, '<td valign="top">gummies distract from the subject too much.</td>', 'gummies distract from the subject too much.', '2004-08-18 19:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(866382, 97941, 22392, '<td valign="top">i would have cropped a bit more, so just the window was the subject. very nice idea.</td>', 'i would have cropped a bit more, so just the window was the subject. very nice idea.', '2004-08-18 19:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(866402, 97470, 22392, '<td valign="top">the border is a bit distracting. The picture is fantastic. 9</td>', 'the border is a bit distracting. The picture is fantastic. 9', '2004-08-18 19:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(866609, 97937, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of the plants texture but lighting and composition are lacking.  There is too much clutter and with the exception of the leaves texture, there isn''t much else to look at.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of the plants texture but lighting and composition are lacking.  There is too much clutter and with the exception of the leaves texture, there isn''t much else to look at.', '2004-08-18 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(866621, 97960, 5822, '<td valign="top">This image appears to be a cut out of a print leaving perspective very distorted.  While the shapes have some interest (even with the distortion) the color is drab and leaves lack interesting detail.  Lighting is too harsh, especially evident at the top.</td>', 'This image appears to be a cut out of a print leaving perspective very distorted.  While the shapes have some interest (even with the distortion) the color is drab and leaves lack interesting detail.  Lighting is too harsh, especially evident at the top.', '2004-08-18 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(866642, 97655, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. this looks the eye on a alligator .. great shot</td>', 'wow .. this looks the eye on a alligator .. great shot', '2004-08-18 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(866653, 98001, 7152, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but the composition throws me off a bit .. first I wish it was more straight (the stem) then then maybe up higher (the plant)</td>', 'I like this picture but the composition throws me off a bit .. first I wish it was more straight (the stem) then then maybe up higher (the plant)', '2004-08-18 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(866654, 97844, 7152, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-08-18 22:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(866661, 97483, 7152, '<td valign="top">very nice picture .. the composition is great ... I wish the flower was lit up a bit more.</td>', 'very nice picture .. the composition is great ... I wish the flower was lit up a bit more.', '2004-08-18 22:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(866670, 97946, 7152, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is "plant life" .. and not only does it meet the challenge its technically perfect .. hope this places (10)</td>', 'Now THIS is "plant life" .. and not only does it meet the challenge its technically perfect .. hope this places (10)', '2004-08-18 22:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(866674, 97810, 7152, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition .. only thing is that dark spot in the corner (not sure if you have photoshop or something but you could have removed that otherwise)</td>', 'nice colors, composition .. only thing is that dark spot in the corner (not sure if you have photoshop or something but you could have removed that otherwise)', '2004-08-18 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(866675, 97912, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. I like this .. only thing that I''m not really fond of are those red/ping flowers in the backgorund</td>', 'wow .. I like this .. only thing that I''m not really fond of are those red/ping flowers in the backgorund', '2004-08-18 22:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(866677, 98016, 7152, '<td valign="top">WOW ... this is the best waterlilly I''ve seen so far (and probably the best in the challenge) .. great composition</td>', 'WOW ... this is the best waterlilly I''ve seen so far (and probably the best in the challenge) .. great composition', '2004-08-18 22:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(866680, 97411, 7152, '<td valign="top">WOW .... this is one of those few shots that really meets the challenge .. not just a shot of a plant .. but a shot of "plant life" ... perfect DOF .. composition .. focus .. you''ve done it all really well .. this trully deserves a 10 and a finish in the top .. good luck</td>', 'WOW .... this is one of those few shots that really meets the challenge .. not just a shot of a plant .. but a shot of "plant life" ... perfect DOF .. composition .. focus .. you''ve done it all really well .. this trully deserves a 10 and a finish in the top .. good luck', '2004-08-18 22:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(866681, 97550, 7152, '<td valign="top">Wow .. neat .. not sure how much I like the over-exposing there but still very nice</td>', 'Wow .. neat .. not sure how much I like the over-exposing there but still very nice', '2004-08-18 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(866683, 97872, 7152, '<td valign="top">very nice ... incredible tree .. but I''m sure peope have told you that the hole is over exposed .. besides that a great shot</td>', 'very nice ... incredible tree .. but I''m sure peope have told you that the hole is over exposed .. besides that a great shot', '2004-08-18 22:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(866684, 97851, 7152, '<td valign="top">good use of DOF</td>', 'good use of DOF', '2004-08-18 22:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(866687, 97605, 7152, '<td valign="top">all I can say is cool .. I love the colors  and the effect they create</td>', 'all I can say is cool .. I love the colors  and the effect they create', '2004-08-18 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(866708, 97652, 18933, '<td valign="top">great photo but she is the focus not the plant</td>', 'great photo but she is the focus not the plant', '2004-08-18 23:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(866776, 97891, 10390, '<td valign="top">Macro shots can often be very interesting.  I like the motive you''ve got here but the composition IMO could be slightly better with the drop placed further from the central of the image, maybe a little bit more down to the right corner just the drop''s size down to the right.  And then I think it''s better to crop one third off from the top. Then you would have a better composition IMHO and a better photo.  The green overall tone is great.</td>', 'Macro shots can often be very interesting.  I like the motive you''ve got here but the composition IMO could be slightly better with the drop placed further from the central of the image, maybe a little bit more down to the right corner just the drop''s size down to the right.  And then I think it''s better to crop one third off from the top. Then you would have a better composition IMHO and a better photo.  The green overall tone is great.', '2004-08-18 23:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(866784, 97551, 10390, '<td valign="top">I like the deep contrast and deep juicy colors in this image, also  a good placement for the sharp flower, but the out-of-focus flower to the left is a bit distracting, maybe a more blurred background would work better or a cropped version without the flower on the left.  But this is a good photo overall.</td>', 'I like the deep contrast and deep juicy colors in this image, also  a good placement for the sharp flower, but the out-of-focus flower to the left is a bit distracting, maybe a more blurred background would work better or a cropped version without the flower on the left.  But this is a good photo overall.', '2004-08-18 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(866795, 97538, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very well seen, but if you would have submitted a cropped version of this photo, without the leaf on the left, then I think you would have been at the top of the challenge with this photo. Great, I like it.</td>', 'Very well seen, but if you would have submitted a cropped version of this photo, without the leaf on the left, then I think you would have been at the top of the challenge with this photo. Great, I like it.', '2004-08-18 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(866800, 96797, 10390, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit to tight framing on the right site, but I like the tones and the idea, maybe a centered version would have been the thing for this!?</td>', 'Just a little bit to tight framing on the right site, but I like the tones and the idea, maybe a centered version would have been the thing for this!?', '2004-08-19 00:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(866803, 97842, 8891, '<td valign="top">This reminds very much of shots I''ve seen on Enature flower ID files. You have isolated this plant quite well. Like the textures and the DOF very much. Fret not, while it reminds of this enature files, it is much better than the ones they have. Very nice effort.  Good luck!</td>', 'This reminds very much of shots I''ve seen on Enature flower ID files. You have isolated this plant quite well. Like the textures and the DOF very much. Fret not, while it reminds of this enature files, it is much better than the ones they have. Very nice effort.  Good luck!', '2004-08-19 00:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(866810, 97493, 24846, '<td valign="top">Paradise. Great colors, composition, like those foxtail ferns too.</td>', 'Paradise. Great colors, composition, like those foxtail ferns too.', '2004-08-19 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(866820, 97930, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is sort of nice - if only it weren''t bigs -  If I imagine ir is something christmasy I love the colors and the pattern the colors make with the spikey black legs,  I like the composition, even though it is so centered.  all the creepies are creeping left, upside down or right side up.  I like the vague out of DOF background,  I like that there is no sense of scale, it helps make the bugs into an abstract pattern.  They could be made of glass.  please tell me they are teeny tiny - too small for me even to see. 8</td>', 'This is sort of nice - if only it weren''t bigs -  If I imagine ir is something christmasy I love the colors and the pattern the colors make with the spikey black legs,  I like the composition, even though it is so centered.  all the creepies are creeping left, upside down or right side up.  I like the vague out of DOF background,  I like that there is no sense of scale, it helps make the bugs into an abstract pattern.  They could be made of glass.  please tell me they are teeny tiny - too small for me even to see. 8', '2004-08-19 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(866910, 96919, 25498, '<td valign="top">very well taken- i love the simplicity and clarity</td>', 'very well taken- i love the simplicity and clarity', '2004-08-19 01:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(866971, 97011, 13336, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand your title</td>', 'i don''t understand your title', '2004-08-19 02:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(867072, 97929, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really nice vivid and bright colors. Color contrast is very good, as well as, DOF. A good picture depicting botony.</td>', 'Really nice vivid and bright colors. Color contrast is very good, as well as, DOF. A good picture depicting botony.', '2004-08-19 05:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(867074, 97904, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not  at all a bad attempt at a very design-lead stylish image. I think, however, that such very stylised photography requires a bit more PS work to really give it some pop - or a bitt more set-up care. Problems for me are an overall graininess of feel, a sense of wrong colouration on the chin (from those small hairs, and easily fixable I''d have thought), the white marks on the rose, and a feeling of congestion within the image which comes from cropping so very close to the subjects - the rose and the lips. It feels a little lke standing too close to a wall - there is no spcae for the eye to circulate around the image. It has the beginnings of an intersting idea however, certainly - just perhaps needs a bit more definition in terms of light and shape. 6</td>', 'Not  at all a bad attempt at a very design-lead stylish image. I think, however, that such very stylised photography requires a bit more PS work to really give it some pop - or a bitt more set-up care. Problems for me are an overall graininess of feel, a sense of wrong colouration on the chin (from those small hairs, and easily fixable I''d have thought), the white marks on the rose, and a feeling of congestion within the image which comes from cropping so very close to the subjects - the rose and the lips. It feels a little lke standing too close to a wall - there is no spcae for the eye to circulate around the image. It has the beginnings of an intersting idea however, certainly - just perhaps needs a bit more definition in terms of light and shape. 6', '2004-08-19 05:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(867076, 98020, 6999, '<td valign="top">Light on the tomato quite appealing, white/grey blur of cloth quite strong compositionally here, though your positioning of eleents within your chosen crop is a little odd - that vertical grey area image left is strongly placed, and draws the eye quite strongly for a figurative image. It''s also prettty small, which hides a great deal of detail for me.</td>', 'Light on the tomato quite appealing, white/grey blur of cloth quite strong compositionally here, though your positioning of eleents within your chosen crop is a little odd - that vertical grey area image left is strongly placed, and draws the eye quite strongly for a figurative image. It''s also prettty small, which hides a great deal of detail for me.', '2004-08-19 05:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(867090, 97041, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower/abstract. Wonderful color tones that are silky smooth. Composition has beautiful graceful lines and it''s assymetricalness does not bore the eye. Really wonderful macro shot. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful flower/abstract. Wonderful color tones that are silky smooth. Composition has beautiful graceful lines and it''s assymetricalness does not bore the eye. Really wonderful macro shot. Well done.', '2004-08-19 05:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(867094, 97830, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and waterfall that you''ve exposed and composed very well. I just don''t see this fitting the challenge theme.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and waterfall that you''ve exposed and composed very well. I just don''t see this fitting the challenge theme.', '2004-08-19 05:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(867102, 97655, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice textural study that you''ve captured well with interesting sweeping lines almost made into a pictorial element (eye).  I would like to see a bit more space around the "eye" and a little more DOF (edges appear oof).  Colors also appear a bit too processed and pushed almost unnatural.  Lighting seems uneven and you could have possibly used some fill in the upper right to even things out.</td>', 'Very nice textural study that you''ve captured well with interesting sweeping lines almost made into a pictorial element (eye).  I would like to see a bit more space around the "eye" and a little more DOF (edges appear oof).  Colors also appear a bit too processed and pushed almost unnatural.  Lighting seems uneven and you could have possibly used some fill in the upper right to even things out.', '2004-08-19 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(867107, 97285, 5822, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W seems such a disservice to the beautiful colors that I''m sure this scene affords. Contrast is a bit too high and detail is missing in both highlights and shadows.  It''s too bad because composition really looks good.</td>', 'The B&W seems such a disservice to the beautiful colors that I''m sure this scene affords. Contrast is a bit too high and detail is missing in both highlights and shadows.  It''s too bad because composition really looks good.', '2004-08-19 06:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(867118, 97984, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully saturated colors and I like the color contrast here. DOF is excellent. Composition is a mixed bag as I like the natural frame produced by the overarching foliage in the background, but the foliage below invades the space of the flower''s stamens and is quite distracting.  One more nit pick: there seems to be a leaf out of place in the upper left hand corner.</td>', 'Beautifully saturated colors and I like the color contrast here. DOF is excellent. Composition is a mixed bag as I like the natural frame produced by the overarching foliage in the background, but the foliage below invades the space of the flower''s stamens and is quite distracting.  One more nit pick: there seems to be a leaf out of place in the upper left hand corner.', '2004-08-19 06:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(867121, 97286, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract with interesting colors and shapes but I don''t think this meets the challenge theme.  From the standpoint of being a pic outside of the challenge it''s very good and original.  The colors are very attractive, as are the shapes, and the glass through which it is shot adds an extra element of interesting texture.  Would score very high with me in another appropo challenge.</td>', 'Very nice abstract with interesting colors and shapes but I don''t think this meets the challenge theme.  From the standpoint of being a pic outside of the challenge it''s very good and original.  The colors are very attractive, as are the shapes, and the glass through which it is shot adds an extra element of interesting texture.  Would score very high with me in another appropo challenge.', '2004-08-19 06:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(867123, 97330, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the golden tones and the lighting is very good and contrasty.  This shot is more artistic than scientific representation and as such I don''t believe it meets the challenge them 100%.  Compositionally too centered and the two "bunny rabbit ears" shapes in the lower right compete for attention.</td>', 'Love the golden tones and the lighting is very good and contrasty.  This shot is more artistic than scientific representation and as such I don''t believe it meets the challenge them 100%.  Compositionally too centered and the two "bunny rabbit ears" shapes in the lower right compete for attention.', '2004-08-19 06:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(867129, 97904, 5822, '<td valign="top">A magnificent composition. The selective desaturation is brilliant and along with the soft focus and contrasty lighting makes this a period piece (30''s, 40''s, 50''s).  Only problem is that I do not see this as meeting the challenge theme. This is artistic as opposed to scientific representation, whiich I believe the challenge is about.  Would be a 10 otherwise.</td>', 'A magnificent composition. The selective desaturation is brilliant and along with the soft focus and contrasty lighting makes this a period piece (30''s, 40''s, 50''s).  Only problem is that I do not see this as meeting the challenge theme. This is artistic as opposed to scientific representation, whiich I believe the challenge is about.  Would be a 10 otherwise.', '2004-08-19 06:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(867140, 97576, 7531, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much, the color is great too, a little noisy in places but maybe that adds to the overall effect. A little small would of like to have seen a larger image but you''ve cropped it right.</td>', 'I like the composition very much, the color is great too, a little noisy in places but maybe that adds to the overall effect. A little small would of like to have seen a larger image but you''ve cropped it right.', '2004-08-19 07:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
