(867830, 97937, 16046, '<td valign="top">the water looks like liquid mercury, not that it''s a bad thing. Good DOF</td>', 'the water looks like liquid mercury, not that it''s a bad thing. Good DOF', '2004-08-19 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(867831, 98016, 16046, '<td valign="top">good exposure, nice detail</td>', 'good exposure, nice detail', '2004-08-19 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(867834, 97938, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great, could have used a more contasting background, still a fine image</td>', 'Great, could have used a more contasting background, still a fine image', '2004-08-19 18:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(867856, 97943, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice picture, love the colors but would have been better with more depth of field</td>', 'nice picture, love the colors but would have been better with more depth of field', '2004-08-19 18:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(868013, 97348, 18349, '<td valign="top">What an interesting angle and specimen... I would imagine being in such a beautiful place made it difficult to choose a subject.  I can''t imagine how you got this shot.  Getting there must have been at least half the fun.  Good job!  :o)</td>', 'What an interesting angle and specimen... I would imagine being in such a beautiful place made it difficult to choose a subject.  I can''t imagine how you got this shot.  Getting there must have been at least half the fun.  Good job!  :o)', '2004-08-19 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(868071, 97799, 24763, '<td valign="top">A nice shot. where is CO2, can''t see H2O,  just joke )):</td>', 'A nice shot. where is CO2, can''t see H2O,  just joke )):', '2004-08-19 21:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(868073, 97654, 24763, '<td valign="top">this plant doesn''t need much light, ha ha )):<br/>Interesting shot.</td>', 'this plant doesn''t need much light, ha ha )):Interesting shot.', '2004-08-19 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(868098, 97722, 2764, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus - is it perhaps too tightly cropped?  I like the closed secretive look of the center petals and I like the way the smooth ribbed yellow petals contrast in texture with the skkikey outer leaves.,  Just the composition that is lacking a punch.  Wonder if the image were square whether the dead center position might work better? 7</td>', 'Very nice focus - is it perhaps too tightly cropped?  I like the closed secretive look of the center petals and I like the way the smooth ribbed yellow petals contrast in texture with the skkikey outer leaves.,  Just the composition that is lacking a punch.  Wonder if the image were square whether the dead center position might work better? 7', '2004-08-19 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(868157, 97411, 4267, '<td valign="top">the botanyin this photo  is not the main subject.. therefore does not meet the challenge.. sorry</td>', 'the botanyin this photo  is not the main subject.. therefore does not meet the challenge.. sorry', '2004-08-19 23:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(868203, 97167, 10055, '<td valign="top">good use of a macro shot and nice detail...However, manage not to have that splinter of black in the lower right cornner as it is obtrusive...Good luck.<br/></td>', 'good use of a macro shot and nice detail...However, manage not to have that splinter of black in the lower right cornner as it is obtrusive...Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(868204, 97765, 10055, '<td valign="top">I like the meltalic lighting to the leaves....makes it more appealling. Very crisp and the shallow DOF does well I think. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the meltalic lighting to the leaves....makes it more appealling. Very crisp and the shallow DOF does well I think. Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(868206, 97539, 10055, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot...makes me want to have a nice cup of java and reflect....Wonderful use of manageing not to over expose the shot while shooing into the Sun.</td>', 'Lovely shot...makes me want to have a nice cup of java and reflect....Wonderful use of manageing not to over expose the shot while shooing into the Sun.', '2004-08-20 00:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(868211, 97988, 10055, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors of green. IMO, green is a dull color to photograph...here, you have demostrated that it can be done...Great work and the water droplets adds so much to the photo as well. Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful colors of green. IMO, green is a dull color to photograph...here, you have demostrated that it can be done...Great work and the water droplets adds so much to the photo as well. Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(868215, 97843, 10055, '<td valign="top">Ah ha, there is color and life in a desert! :) Lovely shot. Perhaps it may be that the details are lost due to resizeing, but I hope that your larger photo shares this...won''t knock down points for this...good luck.</td>', 'Ah ha, there is color and life in a desert! :) Lovely shot. Perhaps it may be that the details are lost due to resizeing, but I hope that your larger photo shares this...won''t knock down points for this...good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(868216, 97830, 10055, '<td valign="top">Well, which plant should I look at...:) Nicely done, and shutter speed was set just right for the water.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well, which plant should I look at...:) Nicely done, and shutter speed was set just right for the water.  Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(868218, 97847, 10055, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, nice soft lighting adds so much to a single rose..I also like that the background isn''t solid black and has a hint of blue. Oh there is a speck on the rose...opps, it was on my LCD...:) Good luck.</td>', 'Hmmm, nice soft lighting adds so much to a single rose..I also like that the background isn''t solid black and has a hint of blue. Oh there is a speck on the rose...opps, it was on my LCD...:) Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(868219, 97558, 24494, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2004-08-20 00:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(868220, 97515, 10055, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the shadows displayed here....and seeing the details of each pad...nicely done and good luck.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the shadows displayed here....and seeing the details of each pad...nicely done and good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(868223, 97828, 24494, '<td valign="top">very pretty i like this shot</td>', 'very pretty i like this shot', '2004-08-20 00:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(868226, 98013, 10055, '<td valign="top">Mabe is the way that it was resized and lost some details in the foreground of the flowers...seems to be blown out  a bit and blurry....However, nicely done. Perhaps spot metering could help too...Good luck.</td>', 'Mabe is the way that it was resized and lost some details in the foreground of the flowers...seems to be blown out  a bit and blurry....However, nicely done. Perhaps spot metering could help too...Good luck.', '2004-08-20 00:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(868227, 97330, 24494, '<td valign="top">9</td>', '9', '2004-08-20 00:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(868228, 97858, 10055, '<td valign="top">Creative use of color shifting...makes it interesing to look at....I feel the same way about certain things, like plants!</td>', 'Creative use of color shifting...makes it interesing to look at....I feel the same way about certain things, like plants!', '2004-08-20 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(868232, 97671, 24494, '<td valign="top">looks like a bomb went off back there, very pretty bomb</td>', 'looks like a bomb went off back there, very pretty bomb', '2004-08-20 00:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(868235, 98016, 10055, '<td valign="top">What can I say? Perfect....your done and mastered photographing plants....move and shoot something else... Wondeful shot.</td>', 'What can I say? Perfect....your done and mastered photographing plants....move and shoot something else... Wondeful shot.', '2004-08-20 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(868238, 97293, 10055, '<td valign="top">i like to see more detail of the background pedals...perhaps to much DOF....</td>', 'i like to see more detail of the background pedals...perhaps to much DOF....', '2004-08-20 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(868240, 97984, 10055, '<td valign="top">NICE, wonderful shot as I was looking through some plants and finding a hidden treasure of elegance.</td>', 'NICE, wonderful shot as I was looking through some plants and finding a hidden treasure of elegance.', '2004-08-20 00:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(868242, 97760, 10055, '<td valign="top">NIce shot of useing macro. details very clear and crisp. Good luck</td>', 'NIce shot of useing macro. details very clear and crisp. Good luck', '2004-08-20 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(868290, 98014, 19708, '<td valign="top">The subject matter here is superb!<br/>Lighting is great and had this been shot at a little lower of angle,<br/>and been just a bit sharper, it would have punched to the top!<br/>A well-deserved ((7)).<br/> <br/></td>', 'The subject matter here is superb!Lighting is great and had this been shot at a little lower of angle,and been just a bit sharper, it would have punched to the top!A well-deserved ((7)). ', '2004-08-20 02:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(868295, 98001, 24976, '<td valign="top">nice use of complementary colors... the plant doesnt look real for some reason imo.</td>', 'nice use of complementary colors... the plant doesnt look real for some reason imo.', '2004-08-20 03:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(868297, 97470, 24976, '<td valign="top">i feel the frame detracts from the photo</td>', 'i feel the frame detracts from the photo', '2004-08-20 03:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(868298, 98004, 24976, '<td valign="top">the dof is a bit too shallow imo, a bit more of the central aloe in focus would have made a much stronger effect.</td>', 'the dof is a bit too shallow imo, a bit more of the central aloe in focus would have made a much stronger effect.', '2004-08-20 03:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(868300, 97750, 24976, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition, maybe the boy should have been a bit closer to the plant. but still brilliant! 9</td>', 'wonderful composition, maybe the boy should have been a bit closer to the plant. but still brilliant! 9', '2004-08-20 03:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(868301, 97732, 24976, '<td valign="top">imo needs some white tones in the photo to better balance the blacks, right now the lights are more yellow than white</td>', 'imo needs some white tones in the photo to better balance the blacks, right now the lights are more yellow than white', '2004-08-20 03:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(868303, 97941, 24976, '<td valign="top">i think you shoulda cropped the bed in the bottom, or moved it out for this shot. I also think that the photo would have been stronger if the window wasnt converging to the right because that tends to lead the eye towards the point of convergence and hence off the photo enterily rather than leading the eye into the garden. (I hope I dont sound too critical, cheers!)</td>', 'i think you shoulda cropped the bed in the bottom, or moved it out for this shot. I also think that the photo would have been stronger if the window wasnt converging to the right because that tends to lead the eye towards the point of convergence and hence off the photo enterily rather than leading the eye into the garden. (I hope I dont sound too critical, cheers!)', '2004-08-20 03:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(868304, 97285, 24976, '<td valign="top">the lighter small flowers to the right are competing for attention with the sunflower, also there is a strange lack of pure white in your photo (maybe check your monitor calibrations) 8</td>', 'the lighter small flowers to the right are competing for attention with the sunflower, also there is a strange lack of pure white in your photo (maybe check your monitor calibrations) 8', '2004-08-20 03:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(868306, 97966, 24976, '<td valign="top">i really like the tones and the composition. 9</td>', 'i really like the tones and the composition. 9', '2004-08-20 03:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(868307, 97883, 24976, '<td valign="top">the colors here are simple but yet amazing together. 9</td>', 'the colors here are simple but yet amazing together. 9', '2004-08-20 03:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(868308, 97605, 24976, '<td valign="top">imo this is a bit too overprocessed</td>', 'imo this is a bit too overprocessed', '2004-08-20 03:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(868312, 97652, 24976, '<td valign="top">the leaves dont seem to be the same ''quality'' as the face. For the face i would give a 10, the leaves just dont seem right. 8</td>', 'the leaves dont seem to be the same ''quality'' as the face. For the face i would give a 10, the leaves just dont seem right. 8', '2004-08-20 03:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(868313, 97947, 24976, '<td valign="top">imo a bit more contrast would make this a lot stronger photo. 8</td>', 'imo a bit more contrast would make this a lot stronger photo. 8', '2004-08-20 03:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(868314, 97875, 24976, '<td valign="top">i love the narrative elements in this picture. it really tells a story! excellently done, and its originality is well welcomed. 10</td>', 'i love the narrative elements in this picture. it really tells a story! excellently done, and its originality is well welcomed. 10', '2004-08-20 03:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(868337, 97333, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and nice display of texture.</td>', 'Very good lighting and nice display of texture.', '2004-08-20 06:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(868338, 97966, 16301, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting/shadows, lovely tone too...</td>', 'I like the lighting/shadows, lovely tone too...', '2004-08-20 06:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(868339, 97331, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice tone, I like the water drops. I somehow feel that the sharpening is a bit excessive though.</td>', 'Very nice tone, I like the water drops. I somehow feel that the sharpening is a bit excessive though.', '2004-08-20 06:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(868340, 97799, 16301, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, it makes each leaf have its own personality. Great job...</td>', 'Excellent lighting, it makes each leaf have its own personality. Great job...', '2004-08-20 06:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(868394, 97551, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, I like the colors in the background...</td>', 'Very nice composition, I like the colors in the background...', '2004-08-20 09:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(868402, 97834, 25510, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetrical composition</td>', 'Nice symmetrical composition', '2004-08-20 09:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(868404, 98023, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simply and highly effective.  Great work.</td>', 'Simply and highly effective.  Great work.', '2004-08-20 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(868413, 97832, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen and composed.  But it could use additional clarity--seems to have some sort of low resolution effect?</td>', 'Very nicely seen and composed.  But it could use additional clarity--seems to have some sort of low resolution effect?', '2004-08-20 10:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(868414, 96655, 12253, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, and I particularly like the misty look near the water!  It would have been great if you could  have captured this a bit wider.  It could also be cropped a little at the top--the green is the star here!</td>', 'Lovely colors, and I particularly like the misty look near the water!  It would have been great if you could  have captured this a bit wider.  It could also be cropped a little at the top--the green is the star here!', '2004-08-20 10:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(868415, 98016, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great contrasting colors, lovely light, and good color and clarity.  Good comp too~</td>', 'Great contrasting colors, lovely light, and good color and clarity.  Good comp too~', '2004-08-20 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(868439, 97605, 7531, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2004-08-20 11:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(868440, 97948, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice image, slight blown out for my taste, I like the orange contrast</td>', 'Nice image, slight blown out for my taste, I like the orange contrast', '2004-08-20 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(868441, 97526, 200, '<td valign="top">interesting ;)</td>', 'interesting ;)', '2004-08-20 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(868443, 97929, 14603, '<td valign="top">Could be straight out of a Botany manual. Nicely observed and executed.</td>', 'Could be straight out of a Botany manual. Nicely observed and executed.', '2004-08-20 11:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(868444, 97930, 16219, '<td valign="top">How true, and a wonderful photograph, though if the aphids in my yard were this beautiful I might prefer them to my own gardening</td>', 'How true, and a wonderful photograph, though if the aphids in my yard were this beautiful I might prefer them to my own gardening', '2004-08-20 11:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(868445, 97347, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully structured image and the use of backlighting makes the picture that little bit different..bumping from 7 to 9.</td>', 'Wonderfully structured image and the use of backlighting makes the picture that little bit different..bumping from 7 to 9.', '2004-08-20 11:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(868453, 97851, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle blue tones in the background..unfortunately, the barbed wire which is essential to your theme, is all but invisible at the top of the picture and only the middle strand stands out.. this serves to cut the image in half which spoils the composition slightly for me.<br/>I think the picture might be strong enough to stand it though.. the white flowers and lovely green and blue tones in the shallow dof background are superb.<br/>Bumping this from 7 to 8</td>', 'I like the subtle blue tones in the background..unfortunately, the barbed wire which is essential to your theme, is all but invisible at the top of the picture and only the middle strand stands out.. this serves to cut the image in half which spoils the composition slightly for me.I think the picture might be strong enough to stand it though.. the white flowers and lovely green and blue tones in the shallow dof background are superb.Bumping this from 7 to 8', '2004-08-20 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(868455, 97912, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of colours here and good use of shallow DOF</td>', 'Nice mix of colours here and good use of shallow DOF', '2004-08-20 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(868460, 97722, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp image and great use of light..straight out of the botany text book.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp image and great use of light..straight out of the botany text book.', '2004-08-20 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(868545, 97190, 23956, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. Shots like this remind me to pay attention to the potentials of motion. I tend to stay inside with the camera on windy days, maybe I shouldn''t...</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. Shots like this remind me to pay attention to the potentials of motion. I tend to stay inside with the camera on windy days, maybe I shouldn''t...', '2004-08-20 13:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(868547, 96797, 23956, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this one, how did you get it? It looks like it''s underlit through the white surface? Great choice of background color, this is really striking!</td>', 'I love the lighting on this one, how did you get it? It looks like it''s underlit through the white surface? Great choice of background color, this is really striking!', '2004-08-20 13:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(868580, 97526, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, although there''s a lot of evidence that the DOF was added after the fact.</td>', 'A nice shot, although there''s a lot of evidence that the DOF was added after the fact.', '2004-08-20 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(868710, 97902, 2764, '<td valign="top">coming up through the magnifying glass?  clever, and a very nice flower - is the background sort of muddy on your monitor - i''ll check again on another computer later -</td>', 'coming up through the magnifying glass?  clever, and a very nice flower - is the background sort of muddy on your monitor - i''ll check again on another computer later -', '2004-08-20 16:19:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(868712, 97744, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I think the strong contrast really works well here.</td>', 'Beautiful, I think the strong contrast really works well here.', '2004-08-20 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(868713, 97620, 2764, '<td valign="top">Why the landscape orientation?  might it look better cropped closer?</td>', 'Why the landscape orientation?  might it look better cropped closer?', '2004-08-20 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(868717, 97966, 4008, '<td valign="top">the soft toning of these leaves really work well (unlike most others B&amp;W/toned images in this challenge). great work.</td>', 'the soft toning of these leaves really work well (unlike most others B&W/toned images in this challenge). great work.', '2004-08-20 16:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(868754, 97844, 24659, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast.  Good job.</td>', 'Like the contrast.  Good job.', '2004-08-20 17:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(868757, 97938, 24659, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Nice contrast.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Nice contrast.', '2004-08-20 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(868764, 96797, 806, '<td valign="top">My first time voting in a few months! :)<br/> <br/>beautiful lighting. good composition too, right down to the choice of vase shape.<br/>I think the ''wow'' factor for me is mostly in the warm glow that reflects the feeling one gets when there is something alive and green around them.<br/>technically good as well. <br/> <br/>;)</td>', 'My first time voting in a few months! :) beautiful lighting. good composition too, right down to the choice of vase shape.I think the ''wow'' factor for me is mostly in the warm glow that reflects the feeling one gets when there is something alive and green around them.technically good as well.  ;)', '2004-08-20 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(868766, 97947, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting! I love the splash of water. brings the whole image to life. another way of "showing what the subject does/can do". I love that in photos. <br/>dof is a bit small, as the leaf with water coming off could be a bit clearer, however, the effect you have achieved works.<br/></td>', 'interesting! I love the splash of water. brings the whole image to life. another way of "showing what the subject does/can do". I love that in photos. dof is a bit small, as the leaf with water coming off could be a bit clearer, however, the effect you have achieved works.', '2004-08-20 17:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(868768, 97336, 806, '<td valign="top">ROFL!<br/>Truely awesome! What a great idea, and done so well!<br/>I have already favorited this for inspiration!<br/>Bravo!</td>', 'ROFL!Truely awesome! What a great idea, and done so well!I have already favorited this for inspiration!Bravo!', '2004-08-20 17:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(868769, 97542, 806, '<td valign="top">I think the levels of blue are too high in the shadows. - you can even see where the green would be crisper without it.<br/>otherwise a simple negative space effect, but I am left wondering where the wow factor is. could have some usefulness as a stock photo - perhaps.<br/></td>', 'I think the levels of blue are too high in the shadows. - you can even see where the green would be crisper without it.otherwise a simple negative space effect, but I am left wondering where the wow factor is. could have some usefulness as a stock photo - perhaps.', '2004-08-20 17:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(868771, 98012, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. a bit too much blue (or maybe magenta making it more purple)  in the shadows though.</td>', 'interesting shot. a bit too much blue (or maybe magenta making it more purple)  in the shadows though.', '2004-08-20 17:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(868772, 97763, 24962, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge fully, is in focus, and includes the study aspect. A 10/10</td>', 'Meets the challenge fully, is in focus, and includes the study aspect. A 10/10', '2004-08-20 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(868773, 97285, 806, '<td valign="top">there seems to have been more light on the smaller flowers giving them more contrast, than on the subject. the grays are too muddy to actually bring this flower alive. a bit more light perhaps, or bring up the levels a bit in post.</td>', 'there seems to have been more light on the smaller flowers giving them more contrast, than on the subject. the grays are too muddy to actually bring this flower alive. a bit more light perhaps, or bring up the levels a bit in post.', '2004-08-20 17:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(868775, 97836, 24962, '<td valign="top">Does what the challenge asks, a study of plants...Botany! Well executed, in focus and an excellent example, 10/10</td>', 'Does what the challenge asks, a study of plants...Botany! Well executed, in focus and an excellent example, 10/10', '2004-08-20 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(868776, 97604, 806, '<td valign="top">very well done. the textures and clarity are terrific. I don''t, however, really like the green upper left and the white upper right corners. I wonder if the green, esp., could have been eliminated.</td>', 'very well done. the textures and clarity are terrific. I don''t, however, really like the green upper left and the white upper right corners. I wonder if the green, esp., could have been eliminated.', '2004-08-20 17:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(868778, 98023, 806, '<td valign="top">ah.. standing tall. interesting concept. like how the leaf points to the diagonal. bit grainy in the shadows. just the mere fact that this is tetering on the stem makes it dynamic.</td>', 'ah.. standing tall. interesting concept. like how the leaf points to the diagonal. bit grainy in the shadows. just the mere fact that this is tetering on the stem makes it dynamic.', '2004-08-20 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
