(869092, 97903, 24546, '<td valign="top">Hit return accidentally - I''ll try again. You''ve got hot spots on your leaves in the foreground and your sky is washed out indicating that this was overexposed. I have found forest shots with greens work better underexposed - makes the greens deeper and richer. Forest pictures also work better on cloudy days when the light is spread more evenly.</td>', 'Hit return accidentally - I''ll try again. You''ve got hot spots on your leaves in the foreground and your sky is washed out indicating that this was overexposed. I have found forest shots with greens work better underexposed - makes the greens deeper and richer. Forest pictures also work better on cloudy days when the light is spread more evenly.', '2004-08-21 01:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(869094, 97676, 24967, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and contrast of this shot!  I might have cleared the web as it is a bit distracting...could just be me though!  Either way. very nice!</td>', 'Love the composition and contrast of this shot!  I might have cleared the web as it is a bit distracting...could just be me though!  Either way. very nice!', '2004-08-21 01:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(869097, 97411, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely macro. You have great detail on the bee and lovely focus on the center of the flower.  However, I feel like the focal point of the picture doesn''t match the challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely macro. You have great detail on the bee and lovely focus on the center of the flower.  However, I feel like the focal point of the picture doesn''t match the challenge.', '2004-08-21 01:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(869099, 97177, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent, absolutely love it.  Very well staged indeed, a lot of effort went in here I imagine.</td>', 'Excellent, absolutely love it.  Very well staged indeed, a lot of effort went in here I imagine.', '2004-08-21 01:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(869100, 97946, 24546, '<td valign="top">Love your picture of the copper beetle (I think that is what they are called.)   Great detail and well composed.  I like your choice of depth of field - your bug is nicely focused and the rest nicely blurs out.  However, I think this photo is more focused on the bug than the botany -not meeting the challenge very well.</td>', 'Love your picture of the copper beetle (I think that is what they are called.)   Great detail and well composed.  I like your choice of depth of field - your bug is nicely focused and the rest nicely blurs out.  However, I think this photo is more focused on the bug than the botany -not meeting the challenge very well.', '2004-08-21 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(869102, 97668, 24546, '<td valign="top">I like your concept here -with your wooden man peeking out through the foliage.  I feel like it would be a stronger picture if you had also gotten the leaf in the upper left more sharply focused. It is such a prominent feature in the photo that it is distracting.</td>', 'I like your concept here -with your wooden man peeking out through the foliage.  I feel like it would be a stronger picture if you had also gotten the leaf in the upper left more sharply focused. It is such a prominent feature in the photo that it is distracting.', '2004-08-21 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(869106, 97947, 24546, '<td valign="top">I like your concept here and the beautiful greens you captured here.  But my feeling is too much of the phot is blurred.</td>', 'I like your concept here and the beautiful greens you captured here.  But my feeling is too much of the phot is blurred.', '2004-08-21 01:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(869108, 97252, 24546, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colors here - nice and sharp - lighting is excellent. And i really like how the naturall lines lead your eye through the photo!  Very nice work!</td>', 'Lovely rich colors here - nice and sharp - lighting is excellent. And i really like how the naturall lines lead your eye through the photo!  Very nice work!', '2004-08-21 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
