(869131, 97862, 24546, '<td valign="top">Love the bold lines that lead your eye to explore this photo. Great detail work in the smaller vein lines.  I think it would have been a stronger composition if the lines had met at one of the thirds position.</td>', 'Love the bold lines that lead your eye to explore this photo. Great detail work in the smaller vein lines.  I think it would have been a stronger composition if the lines had met at one of the thirds position.', '2004-08-21 02:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(869134, 97752, 24546, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the texture of the bark and a nice contrast between the textures of the smooth leaves and the rough bark.  Upper left hand corner is way too hot. I would have recommended either a tighter crop - or framing the photo to avoid that brightly lit area.</td>', 'Great capture of the texture of the bark and a nice contrast between the textures of the smooth leaves and the rough bark.  Upper left hand corner is way too hot. I would have recommended either a tighter crop - or framing the photo to avoid that brightly lit area.', '2004-08-21 02:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
