(869144, 97943, 527, '<td valign="top">On this type of photo I prefer a wider DOF so I can enjoy more of the sunflowers in all of their detail. It is still a very enjoyable photo with nice colors and good framing.</td>', 'On this type of photo I prefer a wider DOF so I can enjoy more of the sunflowers in all of their detail. It is still a very enjoyable photo with nice colors and good framing.', '2004-08-21 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
