(869430, 97975, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity, great composition and crop. The very low angle of lighting on the leaves creates great shadow relief, but maybe a tiny bit too much in this case. Still a great photo. 7</td>', 'Love the simplicity, great composition and crop. The very low angle of lighting on the leaves creates great shadow relief, but maybe a tiny bit too much in this case. Still a great photo. 7', '2004-08-21 13:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
