(869525, 97904, 19936, '<td valign="top">One of my top two picks.  Although it is stretched a little for the Botany challenge (sex sells I guess) I still give it a 10 for the composition, color and clarity.  This shot would make an excellent ad for the rose industry at Valentines Day.  Great shot overall!</td>', 'One of my top two picks.  Although it is stretched a little for the Botany challenge (sex sells I guess) I still give it a 10 for the composition, color and clarity.  This shot would make an excellent ad for the rose industry at Valentines Day.  Great shot overall!', '2004-08-21 15:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(869527, 97929, 19936, '<td valign="top">One of my top two and a 10 in my book.  It stands out in this competition as very different subject and composition.  A great change from the standard flower shots.  I can''t explain the whys but this shot just draws my interest.  I kept going back to it.  Great job!</td>', 'One of my top two and a 10 in my book.  It stands out in this competition as very different subject and composition.  A great change from the standard flower shots.  I can''t explain the whys but this shot just draws my interest.  I kept going back to it.  Great job!', '2004-08-21 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(869530, 97654, 19936, '<td valign="top">This was another very different and interesting shot.  Had the depth of field allowed the new fronds to be in focus I think it would have made a 10, at least from me.  Overall very good.</td>', 'This was another very different and interesting shot.  Had the depth of field allowed the new fronds to be in focus I think it would have made a 10, at least from me.  Overall very good.', '2004-08-21 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
