(869904, 96655, 20324, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice scenery. I would crop it with less sky. (8)</td>', 'This is a very nice scenery. I would crop it with less sky. (8)', '2004-08-22 01:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(869908, 97539, 20324, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Nicely composed. I dont like the black frame. (9)</td>', 'Beautiful! Nicely composed. I dont like the black frame. (9)', '2004-08-22 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(869909, 97336, 20324, '<td valign="top">Funny and creative. I like it! (10)<br/></td>', 'Funny and creative. I like it! (10)', '2004-08-22 01:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(869911, 96723, 23338, '<td valign="top">We''re talking "botany", not candy.  Would be a cute image in a challenge named "animation".</td>', 'We''re talking "botany", not candy.  Would be a cute image in a challenge named "animation".', '2004-08-22 01:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(869912, 97011, 23338, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  Concentrate on botany.  Earlier or later in the day would improve the shadows at the bottom left.</td>', 'Too cute.  Concentrate on botany.  Earlier or later in the day would improve the shadows at the bottom left.', '2004-08-22 01:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(869913, 97668, 23338, '<td valign="top">Personally, don''t like the cute additions of inanimate objects.</td>', 'Personally, don''t like the cute additions of inanimate objects.', '2004-08-22 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(869914, 97336, 23338, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I liked the images better that concentrated on the artistic nature of botanical subjects.</td>', 'Cute, but I liked the images better that concentrated on the artistic nature of botanical subjects.', '2004-08-22 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(869915, 96902, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors and non-colors (blacks, whites and grays), but way off subject for my tastes - maybe not for others.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors and non-colors (blacks, whites and grays), but way off subject for my tastes - maybe not for others.', '2004-08-22 01:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(869917, 96652, 23338, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Simplistic, eye-catching, great contrast of color against black.  Very oriental.  Really like it.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Simplistic, eye-catching, great contrast of color against black.  Very oriental.  Really like it.', '2004-08-22 01:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(869920, 97862, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really great chaos detail, with super \"back lighting\"?  It''s fun to study.</td>', 'Really great chaos detail, with super \"back lighting\"?  It''s fun to study.', '2004-08-22 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(869921, 97988, 23338, '<td valign="top">Eye grabbing composition and contrasts of bright greens against darks and blacks.   Really enjoy the image.</td>', 'Eye grabbing composition and contrasts of bright greens against darks and blacks.   Really enjoy the image.', '2004-08-22 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(869922, 97828, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m a black and white guy and really like patterns in nature, even if man-made.  Nice image.</td>', 'I''m a black and white guy and really like patterns in nature, even if man-made.  Nice image.', '2004-08-22 01:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(869923, 97120, 23338, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about the patterns, colors and details that keeps drawing you in the more you study the image.  Wait! ...  How to escape?</td>', 'There''s just something about the patterns, colors and details that keeps drawing you in the more you study the image.  Wait! ...  How to escape?', '2004-08-22 01:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(869924, 97189, 23338, '<td valign="top">Photo is very reminiscent of Monet.  Lacks focus, but in this case, that''s what makes it.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Photo is very reminiscent of Monet.  Lacks focus, but in this case, that''s what makes it.  Nice composition.', '2004-08-22 01:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(869925, 97347, 23338, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like out of focus objects in the background, but the placement and the extreme detail of the leaves in the foreground make up for it.  And those foreground leaves: the white outlines against the black background with the bright greens ... they''re awesome.  Like the cropping across the top also.</td>', 'I don''t normally like out of focus objects in the background, but the placement and the extreme detail of the leaves in the foreground make up for it.  And those foreground leaves: the white outlines against the black background with the bright greens ... they''re awesome.  Like the cropping across the top also.', '2004-08-22 01:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(869926, 97763, 23338, '<td valign="top">I fully expect to see this in an advertisement somewhere someday.</td>', 'I fully expect to see this in an advertisement somewhere someday.', '2004-08-22 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(869927, 97126, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I think that it would have alot more impact if you left the suculents (spelling)  green and desaturated the rest. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this picture but I think that it would have alot more impact if you left the suculents (spelling)  green and desaturated the rest. Good luck!', '2004-08-22 01:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(869929, 97921, 23338, '<td valign="top">This photo lacks botanic detail.  Clouds?  Seems quite off subject.  If the object were to show silhouettes, then show some which are composed in sync with the clouds, or some which have an attraction in themselves.  These are rather ordinary trees.  Like the purple though.</td>', 'This photo lacks botanic detail.  Clouds?  Seems quite off subject.  If the object were to show silhouettes, then show some which are composed in sync with the clouds, or some which have an attraction in themselves.  These are rather ordinary trees.  Like the purple though.', '2004-08-22 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(869930, 97980, 23338, '<td valign="top">Botany, folks, botany!</td>', 'Botany, folks, botany!', '2004-08-22 01:56:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(869931, 97177, 23338, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but not the thrilling image of nature I was looking for...</td>', 'Cute idea, but not the thrilling image of nature I was looking for...', '2004-08-22 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(869932, 97736, 23338, '<td valign="top">Again, I''m looking for art in nature, not comments about how plants feel, communicate or bleed.  That would be "conversations with nature".</td>', 'Again, I''m looking for art in nature, not comments about how plants feel, communicate or bleed.  That would be "conversations with nature".', '2004-08-22 01:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(869934, 97732, 23338, '<td valign="top">I get it.  It''s even a relatively nice photo.  But, I can''t rate it very high since I really am more drawn to those photos reflecting the beauty of nature.</td>', 'I get it.  It''s even a relatively nice photo.  But, I can''t rate it very high since I really am more drawn to those photos reflecting the beauty of nature.', '2004-08-22 02:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(869936, 97986, 23338, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not one of the images which grab me; make me want to copy them.  It''s not something that I want to frame and put on my wall to enjoy.</td>', 'Interesting, but not one of the images which grab me; make me want to copy them.  It''s not something that I want to frame and put on my wall to enjoy.', '2004-08-22 02:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(869937, 97992, 23338, '<td valign="top">Truck is WAY distracting.  Plants are ordinary.  25% is "plain ole" sky.</td>', 'Truck is WAY distracting.  Plants are ordinary.  25% is "plain ole" sky.', '2004-08-22 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(869938, 97956, 23338, '<td valign="top">Too much out of focus and yet still there.  It''s distracting.  Way cropped down to the 1/8th of the photo with the in-focus water drop would be much more attractive for me.</td>', 'Too much out of focus and yet still there.  It''s distracting.  Way cropped down to the 1/8th of the photo with the in-focus water drop would be much more attractive for me.', '2004-08-22 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(869939, 97010, 23338, '<td valign="top">There is a really nice image in there, somewhere.  Tough image to pull off.</td>', 'There is a really nice image in there, somewhere.  Tough image to pull off.', '2004-08-22 02:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(869940, 97286, 23338, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but...  50% of the interest is "non-botanical".  I like the image, but I''d crop off the container across the bottom.  Doesn''t add anything.  The abstract nature of the marbles is cool.</td>', 'Interesting, but...  50% of the interest is "non-botanical".  I like the image, but I''d crop off the container across the bottom.  Doesn''t add anything.  The abstract nature of the marbles is cool.', '2004-08-22 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(869967, 97470, 23891, '<td valign="top">I find the frame distracting, but otherwise this is a wonderful shot!</td>', 'I find the frame distracting, but otherwise this is a wonderful shot!', '2004-08-22 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(869978, 97828, 23891, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote, but this is my fav. Are the leaves really white?</td>', 'I can''t vote, but this is my fav. Are the leaves really white?', '2004-08-22 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(869999, 97539, 22104, '<td valign="top">Good silhuette photo, even the sun is in a good place. Beautiful colors, Maybe it needs a crop from above.<br/>Good Picture</td>', 'Good silhuette photo, even the sun is in a good place. Beautiful colors, Maybe it needs a crop from above.Good Picture', '2004-08-22 03:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(870020, 97987, 24976, '<td valign="top">i love the colors, but the sharpness and detail are a bit of a let down.</td>', 'i love the colors, but the sharpness and detail are a bit of a let down.', '2004-08-22 04:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(870024, 97904, 24976, '<td valign="top">no offense but the grain and small hairs on the chin and upper lip start to make the face a bit manly. otherwise a really beautiful emotive photo. 8</td>', 'no offense but the grain and small hairs on the chin and upper lip start to make the face a bit manly. otherwise a really beautiful emotive photo. 8', '2004-08-22 04:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(870025, 97671, 24976, '<td valign="top">a bit too overdone, the sky is starting to look like it was borrowed from another photo... nice colors btw</td>', 'a bit too overdone, the sky is starting to look like it was borrowed from another photo... nice colors btw', '2004-08-22 04:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(870027, 97190, 24976, '<td valign="top">wild and exciting! i luv it... 9</td>', 'wild and exciting! i luv it... 9', '2004-08-22 04:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(870028, 97558, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellent, simple and beautiful! 10</td>', 'excellent, simple and beautiful! 10', '2004-08-22 04:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
