(870125, 97551, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, nice dof. I wonder if it would improve by cropping out the flower on the top left?</td>', 'Wonderful, nice dof. I wonder if it would improve by cropping out the flower on the top left?', '2004-08-22 10:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(870126, 97742, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice high key effect, I wonder if a different angle more to the right of the fence would improve this?</td>', 'Nice high key effect, I wonder if a different angle more to the right of the fence would improve this?', '2004-08-22 10:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(870127, 97327, 11897, '<td valign="top">Good closeup shot, I would be tempted to saturate the colours a little more.<br/>Tha harsh lighting has washed them out slightly.</td>', 'Good closeup shot, I would be tempted to saturate the colours a little more.Tha harsh lighting has washed them out slightly.', '2004-08-22 10:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(870129, 97921, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little short of the " wow " factor here. Nice picture but nothing special.<br/>And, like my own entry, stretching the challenge meaning a little :)</td>', 'A little short of the " wow " factor here. Nice picture but nothing special.And, like my own entry, stretching the challenge meaning a little :)', '2004-08-22 10:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(870131, 97956, 11897, '<td valign="top">Could do with a little more contrast and sharpening, nice closeup.</td>', 'Could do with a little more contrast and sharpening, nice closeup.', '2004-08-22 10:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(870133, 97305, 11897, '<td valign="top">I find this a little too central, maybe a view from the left or right could look more interesting?<br/>Looks like harsh sunlight, could be improved by changing the time of day to photograph, the sun has a tendency to wash out the colours, a polarizer filter may have helped here, it would certainly have given better saturation, as it is, try increasing the colour saturation and contrast.<br/>Nice shot, good luck.<br/></td>', 'I find this a little too central, maybe a view from the left or right could look more interesting?Looks like harsh sunlight, could be improved by changing the time of day to photograph, the sun has a tendency to wash out the colours, a polarizer filter may have helped here, it would certainly have given better saturation, as it is, try increasing the colour saturation and contrast.Nice shot, good luck.', '2004-08-22 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(870136, 97336, 11897, '<td valign="top">I like this, great idea, just a little cluttered, I see two many things fighting for the attention of the viewer, the shadow alone wants to be the focus of attention, IMHO<br/>Good luck,</td>', 'I like this, great idea, just a little cluttered, I see two many things fighting for the attention of the viewer, the shadow alone wants to be the focus of attention, IMHOGood luck,', '2004-08-22 10:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(870138, 98002, 11897, '<td valign="top">OK, the dof is good, a suggestion would be to isolate one of the flower stems and concentrate on that, it comes across as very cluttered, nice colours but a tad out of focus.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'OK, the dof is good, a suggestion would be to isolate one of the flower stems and concentrate on that, it comes across as very cluttered, nice colours but a tad out of focus.Good luck.', '2004-08-22 10:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(870139, 97813, 11897, '<td valign="top">Looks like a slow shutter speed, was it on a tripod ?<br/>If not , that is the reason for the lack of sharpness, beautiful colours.<br/>Nice composition, apart from the building, but maybe you couldn''t alter that.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Looks like a slow shutter speed, was it on a tripod ?If not , that is the reason for the lack of sharpness, beautiful colours.Nice composition, apart from the building, but maybe you couldn''t alter that.Good luck.', '2004-08-22 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(870140, 97718, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little uninteresting I''m afraid, the desaturation effect does nothing to help the composition, I would have concentrated on one or two stalks closer in, but that is only my opinion.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'A little uninteresting I''m afraid, the desaturation effect does nothing to help the composition, I would have concentrated on one or two stalks closer in, but that is only my opinion.Good luck.', '2004-08-22 10:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(870142, 97801, 17300, '<td valign="top">Stunning colours and a great photo. Would be intersting to see it without the leaf, which is a distraction. 10 from me.</td>', 'Stunning colours and a great photo. Would be intersting to see it without the leaf, which is a distraction. 10 from me.', '2004-08-22 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(870148, 97973, 17300, '<td valign="top">This flower looks cool. I like it, compared to many of the other straight on shots in this competition. Lovely colours. Would be nice to see it without the somewhat distracting background - with a new photoshoped backgraound in a colour that would bring out the flower even better. Maybe for the prints section?. 10 from me</td>', 'This flower looks cool. I like it, compared to many of the other straight on shots in this competition. Lovely colours. Would be nice to see it without the somewhat distracting background - with a new photoshoped backgraound in a colour that would bring out the flower even better. Maybe for the prints section?. 10 from me', '2004-08-22 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(870150, 96652, 17300, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Just the way I like ''em... 10 from me</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Just the way I like ''em... 10 from me', '2004-08-22 10:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(870151, 97676, 17300, '<td valign="top">Like the blending and mixing of colours (purple and green). 10 from me</td>', 'Like the blending and mixing of colours (purple and green). 10 from me', '2004-08-22 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(870152, 97426, 17300, '<td valign="top">I gave this a nine first, because the cloud part brings it down. But I like the shot anyway so I bumped it up to 10.</td>', 'I gave this a nine first, because the cloud part brings it down. But I like the shot anyway so I bumped it up to 10.', '2004-08-22 11:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(870155, 96914, 17300, '<td valign="top">I see that you''ve met my mother-in-law, too. You managed to get away with all fingers intact, did you? She''s got a nasty bite, she does. 10 from me. Cool shot.</td>', 'I see that you''ve met my mother-in-law, too. You managed to get away with all fingers intact, did you? She''s got a nasty bite, she does. 10 from me. Cool shot.', '2004-08-22 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(870212, 97652, 24494, '<td valign="top">very cool  my favorite good luck</td>', 'very cool  my favorite good luck', '2004-08-22 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(870216, 97542, 18933, '<td valign="top">good comp - nice color</td>', 'good comp - nice color', '2004-08-22 13:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
