(870220, 97782, 18933, '<td valign="top">like the lines and shapes - I would of up pointed if the background was less focused or blacked out</td>', 'like the lines and shapes - I would of up pointed if the background was less focused or blacked out', '2004-08-22 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
