(870320, 97947, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image and I expect you will do well with it.  Good sensitive interpretation of the water &amp; leaf.  In this case, also, the border leads one into the photograph rather than detracting from it.    10</td>', 'This is a stunning image and I expect you will do well with it.  Good sensitive interpretation of the water & leaf.  In this case, also, the border leads one into the photograph rather than detracting from it.    10', '2004-08-22 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
