(870786, 97858, 2764, '<td valign="top">Why the color shift?  It looks interesting on the bee but I don''t think it works on the leaves.  The yellow color is nice.  Perhaps more thought to the composition?  the flowers with dead petals detract.  While the bee is in focus, many of the flowers are not.  Why include the top third of the photo?  Do those extra flowers add anything?  Maybe the bee and the lower flowers would be a better combo?</td>', 'Why the color shift?  It looks interesting on the bee but I don''t think it works on the leaves.  The yellow color is nice.  Perhaps more thought to the composition?  the flowers with dead petals detract.  While the bee is in focus, many of the flowers are not.  Why include the top third of the photo?  Do those extra flowers add anything?  Maybe the bee and the lower flowers would be a better combo?', '2004-08-23 00:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(870788, 97190, 2764, '<td valign="top">While the idea is nice, neither the colors nor the composition here are strong enough to make this a great shot.  One problem is that all your leading lines lead off screen.  Whenever the speed voters eyes are led off the photo, without a balancing line or interest to draw them back they think "Done, next photo" and they don''t give the shot the time it needs.  Maybe if there was something of a different contrast or tone to focus my interst on?  All the colors are about the same level.</td>', 'While the idea is nice, neither the colors nor the composition here are strong enough to make this a great shot.  One problem is that all your leading lines lead off screen.  Whenever the speed voters eyes are led off the photo, without a balancing line or interest to draw them back they think "Done, next photo" and they don''t give the shot the time it needs.  Maybe if there was something of a different contrast or tone to focus my interst on?  All the colors are about the same level.', '2004-08-23 00:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(870792, 97285, 2764, '<td valign="top">nice sunflower, needs more contrast to make it interesting.  Your histogram is pretty flat.  Do the ectra flowers in the background add anything?  They seem distracting to me, especially the bright white ones.  Maybe a different crop would have worked better?  I think of a sunflower as tall, it seems odd to be looking down on it.</td>', 'nice sunflower, needs more contrast to make it interesting.  Your histogram is pretty flat.  Do the ectra flowers in the background add anything?  They seem distracting to me, especially the bright white ones.  Maybe a different crop would have worked better?  I think of a sunflower as tall, it seems odd to be looking down on it.', '2004-08-23 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(870797, 97337, 2764, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, perfect!  is this on a mirror?  I love hoe each petal had a duplicate that is similar but not identical.  Your leading line is direct to the center of the flower and out from there, like an explosion, makes the composition very dynamic. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous, perfect!  is this on a mirror?  I love hoe each petal had a duplicate that is similar but not identical.  Your leading line is direct to the center of the flower and out from there, like an explosion, makes the composition very dynamic. 9', '2004-08-23 00:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(870798, 97829, 25143, '<td valign="top">very good picture; great hairy detail and veins</td>', 'very good picture; great hairy detail and veins', '2004-08-23 00:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
