(871116, 97973, 20324, '<td valign="top">The picture was taken in the Devonian Botanic Garden, Canada''s most northerly botanic garden. I didn''t give the flower a hairdo. It struck me how much it resembles the aperture in a camera, only an early stage of development of this flower looks like this, later the flower is very bushy.<br/></td>', 'The picture was taken in the Devonian Botanic Garden, Canada''s most northerly botanic garden. I didn''t give the flower a hairdo. It struck me how much it resembles the aperture in a camera, only an early stage of development of this flower looks like this, later the flower is very bushy.', '2004-08-23 02:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
