(871207, 97470, 12061, '<td valign="top">Disaster .. lol ... I would definetely not go that far .. but I hate to say I agree with those who didn''t like it. I love borders .. but I do like them kept simple. :) Mabye if you had the border that style but without transparency it would have been better... <br/> <br/>Your photo on the other hand .. is just awesome! Stunning colors and excellent clarity. One thing I would have changed - the petal thats poking up from the bottom .. I would have moved it out of the way ;) Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Disaster .. lol ... I would definetely not go that far .. but I hate to say I agree with those who didn''t like it. I love borders .. but I do like them kept simple. :) Mabye if you had the border that style but without transparency it would have been better...  Your photo on the other hand .. is just awesome! Stunning colors and excellent clarity. One thing I would have changed - the petal thats poking up from the bottom .. I would have moved it out of the way ;) Keep up the great work!', '2004-08-23 03:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(871228, 98016, 19708, '<td valign="top">First time I have missed the countdown and was<br/>worse than a kid at Christmas time.<br/> <br/>Thaks to everyone for their votes and comments, both<br/>during and after the challenge. I was hoping for a top 5,<br/>and was totally jazzed when I got home and found this as a Red!<br/> <br/>Thanks again all, <strike>and I am in process of making the print a bit better.</strike> Update: It''s done!<br/>Regards,<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-24 16:49:44.</i></td>', 'First time I have missed the countdown and wasworse than a kid at Christmas time. Thaks to everyone for their votes and comments, bothduring and after the challenge. I was hoping for a top 5,and was totally jazzed when I got home and found this as a Red! Thanks again all, and I am in process of making the print a bit better. Update: It''s done!Regards,', '2004-08-23 03:42:30.000000', '2004-08-24 17:49:44.000000', 0),
