(871727, 97526, 7531, '<td valign="top">Ok so I added the blur in photoshop and yes everyone that thinks their is too much feathering - your right, there is way too much around the bud of the flower, hmm, funny I didn''t notice until it was pointed out, probably didn''t have my glasses on.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments people<br/> <br/>P.S. To the Person that gave me a one - Get a life<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-23 10:45:48.</i></td>', 'Ok so I added the blur in photoshop and yes everyone that thinks their is too much feathering - your right, there is way too much around the bud of the flower, hmm, funny I didn''t notice until it was pointed out, probably didn''t have my glasses on. Thanks for the comments people P.S. To the Person that gave me a one - Get a life', '2004-08-23 11:45:09.000000', '2004-08-23 11:45:48.000000', 0),
