(872034, 97801, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>:: Hello from the Critique Club  ::</b> <br/>............................................................<br/> <br/>Aha! Mr Pink! This is rubbish - good day to you.<br/> <br/>Nah - seriously it''s got its just position and those comments below are spot-on, but to reiterate:<br/> <br/>&gt; Colour and composition are excellent<br/>&gt; Dangling leaf is quite distracting, although it''s also quite a charming imperfection which shows that the flower''e energy has gone into where its needed - ie, looking pretty to bees, etc.<br/>&gt; Detail is very clear<br/>&gt; Centre of flower is a touch grey from midtone dodging<br/>&gt; Surrounding sky area of flower is also a bit too haloed for my taste.<br/> <br/>Overall - it''s a proficient image which looks very strong on the front page.<br/></td>', ':: Hello from the Critique Club  :: ............................................................ Aha! Mr Pink! This is rubbish - good day to you. Nah - seriously it''s got its just position and those comments below are spot-on, but to reiterate: > Colour and composition are excellent> Dangling leaf is quite distracting, although it''s also quite a charming imperfection which shows that the flower''e energy has gone into where its needed - ie, looking pretty to bees, etc.> Detail is very clear> Centre of flower is a touch grey from midtone dodging> Surrounding sky area of flower is also a bit too haloed for my taste. Overall - it''s a proficient image which looks very strong on the front page.', '2004-08-23 14:49:30.000000', NULL, 0),
