(874317, 97010, 7711, '<td valign="top">hey -- I noticed you thought you needed more feedback on why this image was not very favourably received. <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this, but if I did, I probably would have given it a 4 or a 5. The image seems a bit underexposed and that is really muting any effect. I think the close crop/full frame is fine, but the colours don''t pop and there is nothing to grab attention. The background is dark and I think that when coupled with the dull colours of the flower, its all just a bit bland. Maybe if you had the flower with a different bg or some context to give it a bit of a "story" Its hard to say, but I think the bottom line is...there just isn''t much there to hold attention.</td>', 'hey -- I noticed you thought you needed more feedback on why this image was not very favourably received.  I didn''t vote on this, but if I did, I probably would have given it a 4 or a 5. The image seems a bit underexposed and that is really muting any effect. I think the close crop/full frame is fine, but the colours don''t pop and there is nothing to grab attention. The background is dark and I think that when coupled with the dull colours of the flower, its all just a bit bland. Maybe if you had the flower with a different bg or some context to give it a bit of a "story" Its hard to say, but I think the bottom line is...there just isn''t much there to hold attention.', '2004-08-24 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(874433, 97732, 4226, '<td valign="top">I liked the concept of this photo, this sure represent one aspect of botany, the need and search of water by plants. In this challenge I have felt that creativity scored lesser than the beauty. Wishing you all the best with youe  next submissions and am looking forward to them.<br/>cheers,<br/>KG<br/></td>', 'I liked the concept of this photo, this sure represent one aspect of botany, the need and search of water by plants. In this challenge I have felt that creativity scored lesser than the beauty. Wishing you all the best with youe  next submissions and am looking forward to them.cheers,KG', '2004-08-24 16:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
