(874527, 97010, 23251, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments below. It simply is a sharp image that dosen''t grab your attention.  <br/>I think that if the DOF was increased and maybe playing with the contrast a bit to help it jump out of the photo.<br/>Maybe using a board behind the photo would help centre the attention as well. BTW I gave you a 5 met the challenge.</td>', 'I agree with the comments below. It simply is a sharp image that dosen''t grab your attention.  I think that if the DOF was increased and maybe playing with the contrast a bit to help it jump out of the photo.Maybe using a board behind the photo would help centre the attention as well. BTW I gave you a 5 met the challenge.', '2004-08-24 17:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
