(879623, 97763, 24951, '<td valign="top">When I read your post I expected to see a half assed picture. This shot is theme based, original and clever. To bad the person who gave you 1, isn''t. What a shame that there are people giving marks like this just because they can.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-27 00:23:17.</i></td>', 'When I read your post I expected to see a half assed picture. This shot is theme based, original and clever. To bad the person who gave you 1, isn''t. What a shame that there are people giving marks like this just because they can.', '2004-08-27 01:22:18.000000', '2004-08-27 01:23:17.000000', 0),
